G["forever/collectibles/pets/mayhoa-skyhoof"] = {
	["60s"] = "60银",
	["{npc:268745}, the girl with puppies, walks a long loop through {zone:1454}: from the {object:172957} through the Drag to the {object:172958} and back. The waypoint is where she is seen most, on the road between the Drag and the {object:172958}; if she is not there, walk the loop. The carrier costs 60s. By beta reports she carries one pup at a time: if she has none, another player just bought it, so come back later. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards."] = "{npc:268745}是那个带着小狗的女孩，她在{zone:1454}走一条很长的环线：从{object:172957}穿过暗巷区到{object:172958}再折返。路径点标的是她最常出现的地方，即暗巷区与{object:172958}之间的路上；如果她不在，就沿环线找一圈。携宠袋售价60银。据测试服报告她一次只带一只小狗：如果她没货，说明刚被别的玩家买走，过会儿再来。每个宠物物品使用时即学会对应的小伙伴；成就目标之后会保持勾选。",
}

