G["forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris"] = {
	["Below ground"] = "在地下",
	["Boat to {area:16727}"] = "坐船去{area:16727}",
	["Careful: Shadow Mages (level 42-43) call a Voidwalker while out of combat and attack with Immolate and {spell:686}. Thieves can Disarm you, Rogues move around in Sneak, and Assassins use Execute once you are at 20% health or less."] = "注意：暗影法师（42-43级）在脱战时召唤虚空行者，并用献祭和{spell:686}攻击。窃贼能缴械你，盗贼会潜行移动，刺客在你血量20%或以下时使用斩杀。",
	["Dark Iron Geologist"] = "黑铁地质学家",
	["Dark Iron Lookouts"] = "黑铁瞭望员",
	["Dark Iron Slaver"] = "黑铁奴隶贩子",
	["Dark Iron Taskmaster"] = "黑铁监工",
	["Dunemaul Brute"] = "砂槌蛮兵",
	["Dunemaul Enforcer"] = "砂槌打手",
	["Fly to {area:976}"] = "飞往{area:976}",
	["Further south, Junior Surveyor Scrimshank's gear lies at the mouth of a Centipaar hive.\nCareful: One bug guards the gear. Many bugs patrol the tunnels, some of them level 50, so fights often pull extra adds."] = "再往南，初级勘测员斯克林克的装备躺在森提帕巢穴的入口。\n注意：一只虫子守着装备。隧道里有很多虫子巡逻，有些是50级，所以战斗常会拉到额外的增援。",
	["Gnarled Thistleshrub"] = "多节的蓟灌木",
	["Gor'marok the Ravager"] = "蹂躏者戈玛洛克",
	["Greater Lava Spider"] = "巨型熔岩蜘蛛",
	["Heavy War Golem"] = "重型战争傀儡",
	["Heavy War Golems patrol the Cauldron below Kalaran and drop the oil; the Magma and Blazing Elementals drifting among them drop the hearts. The Dark Iron Taskmasters and Slavers drive the slaves on the paths; a Slaver may drop the {item:11818}: keep it.\nThe Greater Lava Spiders roam the plateaus and lava pools in the south-west of the gorge.\n{area:1443} opens in the north of the Cauldron. Incendosaurs swim in its lava pools: pull them to the edge. The secret plans lie on the pit's upper ledge.\nCareful: Dark Iron Slavers (level 45-46) call for help from allies within 15 yd when pulled, cast Net from up to 15 yd, and use Rend in melee."] = "重型战争傀儡在卡拉兰下方的火山口巡逻，掉落油；在它们中间游荡的岩浆元素和炽焰元素掉落心脏。黑铁监工和奴隶贩子在小路上驱赶奴隶；奴隶贩子可能掉落{item:11818}：留着。\n巨型熔岩蜘蛛在峡谷西南的高地和熔岩池出没。\n{area:1443}在火山口北部开口。炎蜥在其熔岩池里游泳：把它们拉到岸边。秘密计划就在坑的上层岩架。\n注意：黑铁奴隶贩子（45-46级）被拉时向15码内的盟友求援，还会从最多15码外撒网，并在近战中使用撕裂。",
	["His next request needs the {item:10552} from elite cultists: leave it."] = "他的下一个请求需要精英信徒身上的{item:10552}：别接。",
	["Incendosaur"] = "炎蜥",
	["Into {area:51}"] = "进入{area:51}",
	["Kalaran Windblade"] = "卡拉兰·风刃",
	["Kalaran stands alone south of {area:1446}, at the edge of the Cauldron. Listen to his story."] = "卡拉然独自站在{area:1446}南边，大熔炉的边缘。听他讲他的故事。",
	["OOX-17/TN"] = "OOX-17/TN",
	["On the way"] = "顺路",
	["Only with the distress beacon: OOX-17/TN sits south-east of Scrimshank's hive. Escort it north to {area:977}; its reward waits with Oglethorpe in {area:35}.\nCareful: The escort has two ambushes. Three level 47 scorpids attack near the start. Near the end, by the beach, three Wastewander humans attack: one mage and two assassins, around level 44."] = "只在有求救信标时：OOX-17/TN位于斯克林克巢穴东南。护送它向北到{area:977}；奖励在{area:35}的奥格索普那里等你。\n注意：护送途中有两波伏击。开始附近有三只47级蝎子攻击。快到终点、海滩边时，三个废土人类攻击：一个法师和两个刺客，大约44级。",
	["Only with the {item:11818}: back east to the {object:173265} at the dig site."] = "仅当你有{item:11818}时：向东回到挖掘场的{object:173265}。",
	["Ride back north to {area:1446}. Stay here: the next guide starts with the flight to {area:75}."] = "向北骑回{area:1446}。留在这里：下一个指南从飞往{area:75}开始。",
	["Ride north-west across the gorge; {area:1446} is the scaffolded camp in the north-west."] = "向西北骑过峡谷；{area:1446}是西北边搭着脚手架的营地。",
	["Scrimshank's gear"] = "谢申克的勘探设备",
	["South of the {area:982} the Dunemaul ogres hold their compound, with {npc:12046} at its eastern end. Dig up {quest:3161} ornaments between the fights."] = "在{area:982}南边，砂槌食人魔占据着他们的营地，{npc:12046}在营地东端。在战斗间隙挖出{quest:3161}饰物。",
	["Take the pass out of {area:340}'s west side into the {area:51}, then ride south-west to the dig site. The {object:173265} stands at its southern end; the Dark Iron Geologists dig just north of it. Bring 15 {item:4306} (the Auction House sells it)."] = "从{area:340}西侧的山口进入{area:51}，然后向西南骑到挖掘场。{object:173265}立在它的南端；黑铁地质学家就在它北边挖掘。带15个{item:4306}（拍卖行有卖）。",
	["The Dark Iron Lookouts stand on the ridges around the sentry towers south of the Cauldron; about one in ten carries the {item:18960}."] = "黑铁瞭望员站在火山口以南哨塔周围的山脊上；大约每十个有一个携带{item:18960}。",
	["The Dark Iron Steamsmiths work the furnaces in the middle of the Cauldron; half of them carry a {item:10551}, one in ten the {item:18959}. Slaves, Slavers and Taskmasters carry daggers too."] = "黑铁蒸汽铁匠在火山口中央的熔炉干活；他们中一半携带{item:10551}，每十个有一个携带{item:18959}。奴隶、奴隶贩子和监工也会携带匕首。",
	["The Steamsmiths' furnaces"] = "蒸汽铁匠的熔炉",
	["The {area:247}"] = "{area:247}",
	["The {object:179827} board"] = "{object:179827}告示板",
	["Thistleshrub Rootshaper"] = "蓟灌木塑根者",
	["West along the road south; {npc:7771} camps by the ruins at the {area:1938}. Put on his {item:9978}: it shows the buried ornaments, here and around the {area:983}."] = "沿道路向西再向南；{npc:7771}在{area:1938}的废墟旁扎营。戴上他的{item:9978}：它会显示埋在这里和{area:983}周围的饰物。",
	["West of Gadgetzan, use the {item:8584} beside the water hole in the troll camp."] = "在加基森西边，在巨魔营地的水坑旁使用{item:8584}。",
	["West of the compound the cactus creatures fill the valley; only the Dew Collectors carry a dew gland. Most mobs in {area:440} can drop OOX-17/TN's distress beacon, rarely: keep it if you see one.\nCareful: The other thistleshrub mobs in the area are level 49-50 and wander a lot, so you can easily pull extra mobs."] = "营地以西，仙人掌生物布满山谷；只有露水收集者携带露腺。{area:440}的大多数怪物都可能掉落OOX-17/TN的求救信标，但很稀有：看到就留着。\n注意：这一带其他蓟灌木怪物是49-50级，而且到处游荡，很容易多拉到怪。",
	["West, the Centipaar insects swarm around their hives; any of them drops the parts.\nCareful: Centipaar Swarmers cast {npc:4196} both in and out of combat, which brings small adds that interrupt you."] = "西边，森提帕虫群围着它们的巢穴；其中任何一个都会掉落零件。\n注意：森提帕群居者会在战斗内外施放{npc:4196}，带来打断你的小增援。",
	["for {npc:7010} in {zone:1454}, around level 50"] = "给{zone:1454}的{npc:7010}，大约50级",
	["the {item:8526} grows in the {zone:1425}, around level 48"] = "{item:8526}生长在{zone:1425}，大约48级时",
	["the {object:173265}"] = "{object:173265}",
	["{area:1099} flight master"] = "{area:1099}飞行管理员",
	["{area:1938}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:1938}：遇到就杀",
	["{area:51}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:51}：遇到就杀",
	["{item:11818}, a rare drop"] = "{item:11818}，稀有掉落",
	["{item:8623}, a rare drop"] = "{item:8623}，稀有掉落",
	["{npc:5594}, inside"] = "{npc:5594}，在屋里",
	["{npc:5844} along the way to {area:1446}"] = "前往{area:1446}途中的{npc:5844}",
	["{npc:5846} along the way to {area:1446}"] = "前往{area:1446}途中的{npc:5846}",
	["{npc:5854} along the way to {area:1446}"] = "前往{area:1446}途中的{npc:5854}",
	["{npc:5858} on the way"] = "{npc:5858}，途中",
	["{npc:5955} waits in the valley. Walk him all the way to his wife {npc:6015} in {area:977}, north-east across the desert: stay close, slow down for him and fight off what attacks him. Do not mount or hearth out of his reach. {npc:8579} stands in the port too."] = "{npc:5955}在山谷里等候。一路带他到东北方沙漠另一头{area:977}的妻子{npc:6015}那里：紧跟着他，放慢速度等他，击退攻击他的敌人。别骑上坐骑或用炉石离开他的范围。{npc:8579}也站在港口里。",
	["{npc:5955}'s escort"] = "护送{npc:5955}",
	["{npc:7876}, beside the wind rider master"] = "{npc:7876}，在双足飞龙管理员旁边",
	["{quest:3362}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{quest:3362}：遇到就杀",
}

G["forever/horde/40-50/05-the-hinterlands"] = {
	["Back west to {area:350}; rangers and marksmen stay near the lodge, scouts and outrunners on the slopes south of it."] = "向西回到{area:350}；高原游侠和高原神射手待在旅舍附近，高原斥候和高原前锋在旅舍南边的山坡上。",
	["Careful: Stealthed wolves and griffons roam the {area:1883} area."] = "注意：潜行的狼和狮鹫在{area:1883}一带游荡。",
	["East of the village, the violet flower grows in the hills."] = "在村庄东边，紫色水生菇生长在山丘上。",
	["Fly to {area:272}"] = "飞往{area:272}",
	["Fly to {area:321}"] = "飞到{area:321}",
	["Fly to {area:75}"] = "飞往{area:75}",
	["Follow the roads east across the {area:47} to the troll village on the eastern coast. {npc:14736} stands up on top of the inn, above {npc:14731}: go up, the arrow cannot tell the levels apart."] = "沿路向东穿过{area:47}，到东海岸的巨魔村庄。{npc:14736}站在旅店顶上，就在{npc:14731}上方：上去找，箭头分不清楼层。",
	["Highvale"] = "高原精灵",
	["Highvale Marksman"] = "高地谷神射手",
	["Highvale Outrunner"] = "高地谷奔逃者",
	["Highvale Ranger"] = "高地谷游侠",
	["Highvale Scout"] = "高地谷斥候",
	["His next request, going on to the {area:355}, is for a group."] = "他的下一个请求要前往{area:355}，需要组队。",
	["Huntsman Malkhor's skull lies on a pile below the Vilebranch ruins, his bones on a pile at the foot of {area:354}. The Vessels of Tainted Blood sit on the lower terraces, and {npc:14757} is held at the top. Keep to the paths: the trolls inside are elite."] = "猎户莫克霍尔的颅骨在邪枝废墟下方的一堆骨头上，他的骨头在{area:354}脚下的一堆上。污染之血容器放在下层平台上，{npc:14757}被关在最顶上。沿着小路走：里面的巨魔都是精英。",
	["If you skipped {quest:7816}, grind here to level 49.02 to stay on the route's plan."] = "如果跳过了{quest:7816}，在这里刷到49.02级，以保持在路线计划内。",
	["Level 49.02"] = "49.02级",
	["North along the coast, {npc:14731}'s picnic basket is on the small island; a {npc:14748} guards it."] = "沿海岸向北，{npc:14731}的午餐篮在小岛上；一个{npc:14748}守着它。",
	["OOX-09/HL"] = "OOX-09/HL",
	["On the top floor"] = "在顶层",
	["On the way"] = "途中",
	["On the way back east, the Vilebranch soothsayers hold the {area:355}, the troll temple south of the central hills. Qiaga and {npc:8636} (elite, 50) stand at its top: take the soothsayers on the lower steps.\nSouth-west, the Silvermane Howlers roam the hills east of the Witherbark villages."] = "回程向东时，邪枝占卜者占据着{area:355}，即中央丘陵以南的巨魔神庙。恰加和{npc:8636}（50级精英）站在顶端：在下层台阶上打占卜者。\n西南方向，银鬃嗥叫者在枯木村以东的山丘游荡。",
	["Only with the distress beacon: the robot sits at the head of the river west of {area:351}. Escort it east to the shore beyond the {area:307}; its reward waits with Oglethorpe in {area:35}.\nCareful: Two ambushes spawn during the escort: first three wildkin owlbeasts, then three trolls. Before each, the robot halts and announces it senses danger. Oozes, stealthed wolves and a large turtle along the path can join fights, and they respawn even if cleared beforehand."] = "只有带着求救信标才行：机器人停在{area:351}以西的河源处。护送它向东到{area:307}之外的海岸；奖励在{area:35}的奥格索普那里领。\n注意：护送过程中会刷出两次伏击：先是三只野生枭兽，然后是三只巨魔。每次之前机器人都会停下并说它感到危险。路上的软泥怪、潜行的狼和一只大乌龟可能加入战斗，而且即使事先清过也会刷新。",
	["Ride all the way west to the Wildhammer town of {area:348} and place the message by the well in its centre. The town is full of Alliance guards: get in, place it and get out."] = "一路向西骑到蛮锤矮人的城镇{area:348}，把警告放在镇中央的水井旁。镇上全是联盟守卫：进去，放好，然后离开。",
	["Ride back north to the bloodmages."] = "向北骑回血法师那里。",
	["Ride north-east from {area:272} into the {area:47} and east along the road; {npc:7801} camps on the hill south of the elves' {area:350}."] = "从{area:272}向东北骑进{area:47}，沿路向东；{npc:7801}在精灵的{area:350}以南的山丘扎营。",
	["Ride west out of {area:75} and south through the canyon into the {zone:1419}; the two bloodmages stand by the road just inside."] = "从{area:75}向西出发，再向南穿过峡谷进入{zone:1419}；两位血法师就站在入口不远处的路旁。",
	["Saltwater Snapjaw"] = "咸水钳嘴鳄",
	["Savage Owlbeast"] = "野蛮枭兽",
	["Silvermane Howler"] = "银鬃嗥叫者",
	["Silvermane Stalker"] = "银鬃潜伏者",
	["South of the lodge the Witherbark trolls hold their villages. Every one of them carries a skull: with twenty, use {item:15002} to make the Laden Pike, then plant it inside the village."] = "在旅舍南边，枯木巨魔占据着他们的村庄。他们每个都携带头皮：收集到二十个后，使用{item:15002}做成尼姆布亚的长矛，然后把它插在村子里。",
	["South-west again, the exile hides by the ruins of {area:353}."] = "再次向西南，流放者躲在{area:353}的废墟旁。",
	["The Highvale elves camp around {area:350}. Burn the report, the notes and the records in their camps. {npc:7780} is held inside the lodge: lead him out and fight off the ambush on the way.\nCareful: Groups of about three elves ambush the escort, usually twice."] = "高地谷的精灵在{area:350}周围扎营。在他们的营地里烧掉报告、笔记和记录。{npc:7780}被关在屋内：带他出来，并在途中击退伏击。\n注意：大约三只精灵一组会伏击护送队，通常两次。",
	["The big turtles crawl along the beaches north of the village. {npc:2491}'s port bottles lie on these beaches too, but his quest is not on this route. A snapjaw can drop OOX-09/HL's distress beacon, rarely: keep it."] = "大海龟沿着村庄北边的海滩爬行。{npc:2491}的酒瓶也在这些海滩上，但他的任务不在本路线上。钳嘴龟可能掉落OOX-09/HL定位器，但很少见：留着它。",
	["The bloodmages"] = "血法师",
	["The crates of {item:8684} lie around the abandoned Horde camp at {area:351}, among the oozes."] = "一箱箱{item:8684}散落在{area:351}被遗弃的部落营地周围，混在软泥怪中间。",
	["The five quests share the same parts: gather them all in one sweep. West of the road the {npc:5982} vultures, Starving Snickerfangs, Scorpok Stingers and Deatheye basilisks share the hills.\nEast of the road the Ashmane boars and Grunters root on the slopes beside the Redstone basilisks. Stay away from the level 52 Helboars further south.\nCareful: Scorpok Stingers use {spell:5416}; {npc:8301} adds Knockdown."] = "这五个任务用同样的部件：一趟全收齐。路西的山丘上有{npc:5982}秃鹫、饥饿的诡笑者、斯考皮克刺针和死眼蜥蜴。\n路东的灰鬃野猪和咕噜者在红石蜥蜴旁的山坡上拱食。远离更南边的52级地狱野猪。\n注意：斯考皮克刺针会使用{spell:5416}；{npc:8301}还会击倒。",
	["The next guide starts here, at {area:3317}."] = "下一个指南从这里开始，在{area:3317}。",
	["The secret lies on the {area:307}, above the beach."] = "林吉的秘密在海滩上方的{area:307}。",
	["Their follow-ups ask for the same parts again for a buff item and pay no experience: leave them."] = "他们的后续任务又要同样的部件，换取一件增益物品，而且不给经验：别接。",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:7977} is a level 48 elite: most classes solo it at level 50, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back."] = "这些是精英怪：建议组队，找人来一起做。{npc:7977}是48级精英：大多数职业50级可以单挑，但可能需要帮忙。如果只有你一个人就跳过：路线会安排你刷怪补经验。",
	["Underwater"] = "水下",
	["Vilebranch Scalper"] = "邪枝剥皮者",
	["Vilebranch Soothsayer"] = "邪枝占卜者",
	["West of the island, the Vilebranch scalpers hold the temples of {area:1884} and {area:1917}. Slagtree's tools lie at one of the temples.\nThe Silvermane Stalkers, Savage Owlbeasts and Razorbeak Skylords share the hills between the temples and {area:351}. Use the {item:9618} on the owlbeasts you kill. The Skylords also drop Long Elegant Feathers: keep ten for {npc:14738}'s second message.\nCareful: Silvermane Stalkers are level 47-48 and stay stealthed while out of combat. Up close they use {spell:7367}. When a {npc:2925} falls to 50% health or lower, it calls for help from anything within 25 yd."] = "岛以西，邪枝剥皮者占据着{area:1884}和{area:1917}的神庙。斯拉格树的工具在其中一个神庙里。\n银鬃潜伏者、野蛮枭兽和锐喙天空领主分布在神庙与{area:351}之间的山丘。对你杀死的枭兽使用{item:9618}。天空领主还会掉优雅长羽：留十根给{npc:14738}的第二条消息。\n注意：银鬃潜伏者是47-48级，脱战后保持潜行。近身时会使出{spell:7367}。当{npc:2925}生命值降到50%或更低时，会向25码内的任何东西呼救。",
	["for {npc:6986} in {zone:1454}, around level 50"] = "交给{zone:1454}的{npc:6986}，大约50级时",
	["for {npc:7825} in the {zone:1458}, around level 50"] = "交给{zone:1458}的{npc:7825}，大约50级时",
	["grind on {npc:2505}"] = "刷{npc:2505}",
	["{area:1440}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:1440}：遇到就杀",
	["{area:1446} flight master"] = "{area:1446}飞行管理员",
	["{area:1917}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:1917}：遇到就杀",
	["{area:307}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:307}：遇到就杀",
	["{area:321} flight master"] = "{area:321}飞行管理员",
	["{area:3317} flight master"] = "{area:3317}飞行管理员",
	["{area:348} well"] = "{area:348}水井",
	["{area:355}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:355}：遇到就杀",
	["{item:8704}, a rare drop"] = "{item:8704}，稀有掉落",
	["{npc:14731}'s lunch"] = "{npc:14731}的午餐",
	["{npc:14731}, inside"] = "{npc:14731}，在里面",
	["{npc:14736} stands up on top of the inn, above {npc:14731}: go up, the arrow cannot tell the levels apart."] = "{npc:14736}站在旅店顶上，就在{npc:14731}上方：上去找，箭头分不清楼层。",
	["{npc:14757}, at the top of {area:354}"] = "{npc:14757}，在{area:354}顶上",
	["{npc:2926} on the way"] = "{npc:2926}，途中",
	["{npc:7801}'s camp"] = "{npc:7801}的营地",
}

G["forever/horde/40-50/06-azshara"] = {
	["\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley, on the top floor"] = "“海狼”麦金利，在顶楼",
	["Back north-east to {npc:8420}."] = "向东北回到{npc:8420}那里。",
	["Back to {area:1099}"] = "返回{area:1099}",
	["Back to {npc:11548} at the shrine; stay west of the {area:3137} guards."] = "回到神殿的{npc:11548}那里；待在{area:3137}守卫的西边。",
	["Back to {object:3202}"] = "返回{object:3202}",
	["Below ground"] = "地下",
	["Class trainer"] = "职业训练师",
	["Continue south to {area:35}. {npc:7406} has his workshop on the upper ring of the bay."] = "继续向南前往{area:35}。{npc:7406}的工作室在海湾的上层环道上。",
	["Fly to {area:1099}"] = "飞往{area:1099}",
	["Fly to {area:1637}"] = "飞往{area:1637}",
	["Fly to {area:1638}"] = "飞往{area:1638}",
	["Fly to {area:35}"] = "飞往{area:35}",
	["Fly to {area:976}"] = "飞往{area:976}",
	["Fly to {object:3202}"] = "飞往{object:3202}",
	["Fly to {zone:1456}; it is on the way to {area:1099}. No flight path there yet? Fly to {area:378} and ride west through {zone:1412}. Hamuul and {npc:4046} are on the {area:1639}; Druids and Paladins train here ({npc:3033}, {npc:246344})."] = "飞往{zone:1456}；它在去{area:1099}的路上。还没开那里的航线？飞到{area:378}再向西骑过{zone:1412}。哈缪尔和{npc:4046}在{area:1639}上；德鲁伊和圣骑士在这里训练（{npc:3033}、{npc:246344}）。",
	["Follow the road north to {area:1237}, the Horde camp."] = "沿道路向北前往部落营地{area:1237}。",
	["Follow the road south; the basilisks bask on the rocks east of it in the middle of the jungle. Their shards drop often."] = "沿道路向南；蜥蜴在丛林中部道路东边的岩石上晒太阳。它们经常掉落碎片。",
	["Frayfeather Hippogryphs"] = "乱羽角鹰兽",
	["Haldarr Felsworn"] = "哈达尔邪誓者",
	["Haldarr Satyr"] = "哈达尔萨特",
	["Haldarr Trickster"] = "哈达尔欺诈者",
	["Highborne Apparition"] = "上层精灵幻影",
	["Highborne Lichling"] = "上层精灵小巫妖",
	["If you skipped {quest:8552} or {quest:591}, grind here to level 49.93 to stay on the route's plan."] = "如果你跳过了{quest:8552}或{quest:591}，就在这里刷到49.93级，以跟上本路线的进度规划。",
	["Ironjaw Basilisks"] = "铁腭蜥蜴",
	["Keep the deliveries for {npc:4046}, {npc:8659} and {npc:6522}: you pass {zone:1456}, {zone:1454} and the {zone:1458} later."] = "留着给{npc:4046}、{npc:8659}和{npc:6522}的货物：你之后会经过{zone:1456}、{zone:1454}和{zone:1458}。",
	["Keep {npc:8659}'s payment and Ag'tor's {quest:3504}: they go back to {area:1237} on a later visit."] = "留着{npc:8659}的报酬和阿格图的{quest:3504}：之后再去{area:1237}时交还。",
	["Keep {quest:3444}: {npc:7771}'s chest is opened on a later visit."] = "留着{quest:3444}：{npc:7771}的箱子要之后再来时才能打开。",
	["Level 49.93"] = "49.93级",
	["Only once all three robots are home"] = "仅当三个机器人都回家后",
	["Paladin trainer"] = "圣骑士训练师",
	["Ride east along the road out of Splintertree. {npc:11548} waits at the {area:1235} just off the road, a few steps west of the Alliance's {area:3137}: come in from the west and keep clear of the Azshara Sentinels and Jarrodenus (elite)."] = "沿道路向东离开碎木岗哨。{npc:11548}在道路旁的{area:1235}等候，位于联盟{area:3137}西边几步远：从西边过去，避开艾萨拉哨兵和加罗迪努斯（精英）。",
	["Ride into {area:16}"] = "骑进{area:16}",
	["Ride north-east to the goblin's camp on the cliffs above the {area:1227}."] = "向东北骑往{area:1227}上方悬崖上的地精营地。",
	["Ride south-west to the ruins. The four tablets lie among the ruins, guarded by Spitelash naga; any Siren or Myrmidon can carry {npc:8420}'s rune."] = "向西南骑往废墟。四块石板散落在废墟中，由恶鞭纳迦看守；任何恶鞭海妖或恶鞭侍从都可能携带{npc:8420}的符文。",
	["Ride west back to {area:1237}."] = "向西骑回{area:1237}。",
	["South down the road again.\nRide south along the road to the {area:1938}; {npc:7771} camps beside it. From here the road west leads down into {zone:1449}, where the next guide starts."] = "再次沿路向南。\n沿大路向南骑到{area:1938}；{npc:7771}就在旁边扎营。从这里向西的路向下通往{zone:1449}，即下一篇攻略开始的地方。",
	["Sprite Darters"] = "小精龙",
	["Stay here: the next guide starts with the flight to {area:976}."] = "留在这里：下一篇攻略从飞往{area:976}开始。",
	["Take the zeppelin back to {zone:1454}."] = "乘飞艇返回{zone:1454}。",
	["The Highborne ghosts haunt the ruins just north of the shrine; the Haldarr satyrs camp a little further north."] = "上层精灵的幽灵在神殿正北的废墟里出没；哈达尔萨特在更北一点的地方扎营。",
	["The Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays wash along the shore around the dock.\nThe Land Walkers and Cliff Giants roam the hills north of the dock. Zap each one with {item:18904} first: shrunken, they are no longer elite. Every zapped giant drops residue; use the Muisek Vessel on its body too."] = "海元素和海之飞溅在码头周围的岸边游荡。\n陆地行者和峭壁巨人在码头北边的山丘上徘徊。先用{item:18904}把每一只电一下：缩小后它们就不再是精英。每个被电的巨人都会掉落残渣；别忘了对它的尸体使用缪塞克容器。",
	["The Thunderhead Hippogryphs fly over the hills just south of {area:1237}."] = "雷首角鹰兽在{area:1237}正南的山丘上空飞翔。",
	["The blood elves' camp lies just south of {npc:8420}. His four pieces of equipment lie in the crates around the camp."] = "血精灵的营地就在{npc:8420}南边。他的四件设备在营地周围的箱子里。",
	["The faerie dragons flit around the woods just west of the camp. Use the vessel on each one you kill."] = "精灵龙在营地正西的树林里飞来飞去。对你杀死的每一只使用容器。",
	["The flight from {area:75} lands at {area:117}."] = "从{area:75}起飞的航班在{area:117}降落。",
	["The hippogryphs nest on the hills south-west of the camp. Kill one, then use the Muisek Vessel on its body."] = "角鹰兽在营地西南的山丘上筑巢。杀死一只，然后对它的尸体使用灵魂精华容器。",
	["The treants wander the forest roads between the camp and the middle of {zone:1444}; there are only a few, so look along the paths."] = "树人在营地和{zone:1444}中部之间的林间道路上游荡；数量很少，所以沿着小路找。",
	["The {object:2076} beside {npc:2519}"] = "{npc:2519}旁边的{object:2076}",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:818} (level 47 elite) needs a group of 2. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.\nCareful: Two elite caster guards, around level 45, stand with {npc:818} and join the fight together with him."] = "这些是精英怪：建议组队，找人一起做。{npc:818}（47级精英）需要2人小队。单人可以跳过：本路线会安排你把经验刷回来。\n注意：两名约45级的精英法系护卫与{npc:818}站在一起，会随他一起加入战斗。",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {quest:8552} needs a group of 2. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back."] = "这些是精英怪：建议组队，找人一起做。{quest:8552}需要2人小队。单人可以跳过：本路线会安排你把经验刷回来。",
	["To {object:3202}"] = "前往{object:3202}",
	["Undamaged Hippogryph Feathers"] = "完好无损的角鹰兽羽毛",
	["Upstairs"] = "楼上",
	["Wandering Forest Walkers"] = "森林漫游者",
	["Xylem's tower stands on the cliff just north of {area:1237}; the path winds up its north side."] = "克希雷姆的塔建在{area:1237}正北的悬崖上；小路沿塔的北侧蜿蜒而上。",
	["Zeppelin to {zone:1454}"] = "乘飞艇前往{zone:1454}",
	["grind on {npc:6125}"] = "刷{npc:6125}",
	["{area:1099} flight master"] = "{area:1099}飞行管理员",
	["{area:1108}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:1108}：遇到就杀",
	["{area:1221}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:1221}：遇到就杀",
	["{area:1236}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:1236}：遇到就杀",
	["{area:1237} flight master"] = "{area:1237}飞行管理员",
	["{area:75} flight master"] = "{area:75}飞行管理员",
	["{npc:246344} in {zone:1456}; {zone:1454} has no paladin trainer"] = "{npc:246344}在{zone:1456}；{zone:1454}没有圣骑士训练师",
	["{npc:5594}, inside"] = "{npc:5594}，在屋里",
	["{npc:6117} walks around {area:1235}: look inside the circle on the map"] = "{npc:6117}在{area:1235}一带走动：查看地图上的圆圈范围",
	["{npc:6986}, the Drag"] = "{npc:6986}，在暗巷区",
	["{npc:7406}, inside"] = "{npc:7406}，在屋里",
	["{npc:7854}, inside"] = "{npc:7854}，在屋里",
	["{npc:7876}'s tar and Pestlezugg's samples come from {zone:1449}."] = "{npc:7876}要的焦油和匹斯特苏格要的样本都来自{zone:1449}。",
	["{npc:7876}, beside the wind rider master"] = "{npc:7876}，在双足飞龙管理员旁边",
	["{npc:8395}, at the east edge of the camp: no experience, only a teleport to Azshara Tower"] = "{npc:8395}，在营地东缘：没有经验，只能传送到克希雷姆的法师塔",
	["{npc:8659}, the {object:172960}"] = "{npc:8659}，在{object:172960}",
	["{object:3202} flight master"] = "{object:3202}飞行管理员",
	["{quest:3761} is gathered in the next guide; {npc:4046}'s payment goes back to {npc:8587} later."] = "{quest:3761}在下一个指南中收集；{npc:4046}的报酬之后交还给{npc:8587}。",
	["{zone:1454} flight master"] = "{zone:1454}飞行管理员",
	["{zone:1456} flight master"] = "{zone:1456}飞行管理员",
}

G["forever/horde/50-60/01-un-goro-crater"] = {
	["Back north-east to {area:251}."] = "向东北回到{area:251}。",
	["Back to {area:2268}"] = "返回{area:2268}",
	["Back to {area:976}"] = "回到{area:976}",
	["Below ground"] = "地下",
	["Bloodpetal Flayer"] = "血瓣鞭笞者",
	["Bloodpetal Lasher"] = "血瓣抽击者",
	["Bloodpetal Thresher"] = "血瓣脱粒者",
	["Bloodpetal Trapper"] = "血瓣捕猎者",
	["Boat to {area:16727}"] = "乘船到{area:16727}",
	["Bridge into {area:254}"] = "通往{area:254}的桥",
	["Careful: Gorishi Workers may call for help within 25 yd when below 45% health; silithids cast {spell:8137} and Tunnelers and the Hive Guard use {spell:14120}."] = "小心：戈里希工蜂在生命低于45%时，可能会向25码内的同伴呼救；异种虫会施放{spell:8137}，掘地者和蜂巢守卫会使用{spell:14120}。",
	["Careful: Gorishi Workers that drop below 45% health have a 50% chance to call for help from allies within 25 yd."] = "小心：生命降到45%以下的戈里希工蜂有50%几率向25码内的同伴呼救。",
	["Careful: There are many ravasaurs roaming the area, so you can easily pull several at the same time."] = "小心：这一带有许多掠食龙游荡，很容易一次引到好几只。",
	["Careful: {npc:10411} goes invisible when out of combat and calls Rockwing Gargoyles once a fight starts. Only 3 exist and they respawn every 15 min."] = "小心：{npc:10411}在战斗外会隐形，一旦开战就会召唤石翼石像鬼。石翼石像鬼只有3只，每15分钟刷新。",
	["Cross the south of the crater to the pylon on the western cliffs."] = "穿过环形山南部，前往西边悬崖上的水晶塔。",
	["Darrowshire Spirit"] = "达隆郡幽灵",
	["Eastern Pylon"] = "东部水晶塔",
	["Fly to {area:1497}"] = "飞往{area:1497}",
	["Fly to {area:1637} and train before the {object:3202} zeppelin: the {zone:1458} stop later in this guide has no Hunter or Shaman trainer."] = "飞往{area:1637}，在{object:3202}飞艇前学技能：本指南稍后的{zone:1458}站没有猎人训练师和萨满训练师。",
	["Fly to {area:272}"] = "飞往{area:272}",
	["Fly to {area:340}"] = "飞往{area:340}",
	["Fly to {zone:1454}, take the zeppelin to {object:3202} and fly from there to {area:340}, built into the cliffs on the {area:3}' west edge."] = "飞往{zone:1454}，乘飞艇到{object:3202}，再从那里飞到{area:340}，它建在{area:3}西缘的峭壁中。",
	["Follow the cliffs south to {quest:3821}, the Firegut ogres' hill. {npc:9136}'s remains lie at its foot."] = "沿悬崖向南前往火腹食人魔的山丘{quest:3821}。{npc:9136}的遗骸在山脚下。",
	["Follow the road east through the {zone:1422} and across the river into the {area:139}; leave it north for {area:2627}, the ruined town in the north-west. {npc:12384} sits in a hut at its edge."] = "沿路向东穿过{zone:1422}，渡河进入{area:139}；离开主路向北，去西北的废墟小镇{area:2627}。{npc:12384}坐在镇边的小屋里。",
	["Free Darrowshire Spirits: talk to them"] = "释放达隆郡居民的灵魂：和它们交谈",
	["From here on pick up every Power Crystal (blue, green, red, yellow) and every {quest:3761} pile you pass: 25 soil in all, 20 for Hamuul and 5 for Pestlezugg."] = "从现在起，捡起路过的每一块能量水晶（蓝色、绿色、红色、黄色）和每一堆{quest:3761}：总共25份土壤，20份给哈缪尔，5份给匹斯特苏格。",
	["From the {area:1938} ride west to the long ramp that winds down into {area:490}, then follow the crater's north wall to {area:541}, a camp in the cliff caves. Everyone here is neutral."] = "从{area:1938}向西骑到那条盘绕而下进入{area:490}的长坡道，再沿环形山的北壁走到{area:541}，一处位于峭壁洞穴中的营地。这里的人都是中立。",
	["Gorillas"] = "猩猩",
	["Inside"] = "室内",
	["Into the {zone:1427}"] = "进入{zone:1427}",
	["Into {area:490}"] = "进入{area:490}",
	["Keep the parcel: {npc:10781} is in the {zone:1458}."] = "留着包裹：{npc:10781}在{zone:1458}。",
	["Keep {npc:10267}'s letter: {quest:4808} is in {area:2255}, {zone:1452}."] = "留着{npc:10267}的信：{quest:4808}在{zone:1452}的{area:2255}。",
	["Keep {npc:9118}'s {quest:4147} and {npc:8737}'s letter for later guides."] = "留着{npc:9118}的{quest:4147}和{npc:8737}的信，在之后的指南中使用。",
	["Keep {quest:5152}: Marlene lives at {area:197} in the {zone:1422}."] = "留着{quest:5152}：玛莱恩住在{zone:1422}的{area:197}。",
	["Lar'korwi Mates"] = "拉克维的配偶",
	["Lashers and Threshers"] = "抽击者与脱粒者",
	["Leave the {zone:1458} and ride east along the road through {area:85} to the {area:152}, the Forsaken fort on the border."] = "离开{zone:1458}，沿路向东穿过{area:85}，到达边界的被遗忘者要塞{area:152}。",
	["Leave the {zone:1458} and ride east along the road through {area:85}, past the {area:152}. Felstone Farm is the first farm along the road; {npc:10778} waits in the house."] = "离开{zone:1458}，沿路向东穿过{area:85}，经过{area:152}。魔石农场是路上第一座农场；{npc:10778}在屋里等你。",
	["Leave {zone:2548} on foot to the north-west, north of {area:16685}, into the {area:3}."] = "从{zone:2548}徒步向西北，经{area:16685}以北进入{area:3}。",
	["Level 51.81"] = "51.81级",
	["North of Torwa, a dead Threshadon lies by the water."] = "在托尔瓦北边，一头死去的蛇颈龙躺在水边。",
	["Northern Pylon"] = "北部水晶塔",
	["Out of the refuge"] = "离开避难所",
	["Pestlezugg's next quest needs the {npc:10041}, an elite boss. Skip it."] = "匹斯特苏格的下一个任务需要击败精英首领{npc:10041}。跳过它。",
	["Power Crystals and soil"] = "能量水晶与土壤",
	["Ride down the east side of the crater to the pylon on the eastern cliffs."] = "沿环形山东侧骑下去，前往东边悬崖上的水晶塔。",
	["Ride north along the east side. Bloodpetal Lashers and Threshers fill the jungle."] = "沿东侧向北骑。血瓣抽击者和脱粒者遍布丛林。",
	["Ride north back to {area:541}."] = "向北骑回{area:541}。",
	["Ride south back to the road and follow it east across the whole zone to {area:2268}."] = "向南骑回道路，沿路向东穿过整个地区前往{area:2268}。",
	["Ride south-west to {area:537}, the volcano in the middle of the crater. Bloodpetal Flayers grow around its foot.\nSouth of the hot springs, Stegodons graze and Dinosaur Bones drop from them or lie on the ground; Diemetradons nearby carry the scales {npc:9998} wants. Ravasaurs hunt in packs in the south-west: their claws are for {npc:8659}, and now and then one carries a Mangled Journal (a rare drop: take its quest only if you get one). Avoid Gruff, a level 57 Stegodon.\nRide south-west along the western cliffs. {npc:9167} fly over the west side, and Bloodpetal Trappers grow in the same jungle."] = "向西南骑到{area:537}，环形山中央的火山。血瓣鞭笞者长在山脚周围。\n温泉以南，剑龙在吃草，恐龙骨头会从它们身上掉落或散在地上；附近的双帆龙带着{npc:9998}想要的鳞片。掠食龙在西南成群猎食：它们的爪子是给{npc:8659}的，偶尔一只会带着一本破烂的日志（稀有掉落：只有拿到了才去接它的任务）。避开格鲁夫，一只57级剑龙。\n沿西侧峭壁向西南骑。{npc:9167}在西边上空飞行，同一片丛林里还长着血瓣捕猎者。",
	["Ride west to the dig site. {npc:7039} golems (53) stomp around it and drop the shards often; the {quest:4296} stands in its middle among the Thaurissan dwarves. Copy it.\nBlack Broodlings nest in the hills just east of {area:251}. Use {npc:10267}'s {item:12284} on a broodling when it is almost dead to capture its essence."] = "向西骑到挖掘场。{npc:7039}傀儡（53级）在附近踩踏，常掉碎片；{quest:4296}立在挖掘场中央，周围是索瑞森矮人。抄录它。\n黑色雏龙筑巢在{area:251}以东的山丘里。在一只雏龙快死时，用{npc:10267}的{item:12284}在它身上捕获其精华。",
	["Scarlet forward camp"] = "血色前哨营地",
	["Stegodons and ravasaurs"] = "剑龙和暴掠龙",
	["Take a {object:176092} from the crate next to Derrington for {quest:5096}, done on the way back. Equip the {quest:5401}: Scourgestones only drop while you wear it."] = "从德灵顿旁边的箱子里拿一个{object:176092}，用于{quest:5096}，在回程时完成。装备{quest:5401}：只有佩戴它时才会掉落天灾石。",
	["Take the pass out of {area:340}'s west side into the {zone:1427}, then ride south across the gorge to the long bridge into {area:254}. Inside, follow the chain walkways down and leave through the southern exit; stay off the paths to the dungeon portals."] = "从{area:340}西侧的山口进入{zone:1427}，然后向南穿过峡谷，走上通往{area:254}的长桥。进去后沿着铁链走道往下走，从南边的出口离开；别走通往地下城传送门的路。",
	["The Gorishi hive"] = "格里什虫巢",
	["The Lar'korwi Mates prowl the jungle north-west of {npc:9619}."] = "拉克维的配偶在{npc:9619}西北的丛林里潜行。",
	["The Scarlet Crusade's tents stand between {area:199} and {area:200}. Torch the command tent with the {object:176092} and plant the Scourge banner."] = "血色十字军的帐篷搭在{area:199}与{area:200}之间。用{object:176092}点燃指挥帐篷，并插上天灾旗帜。",
	["The book lies in the ruined inn of {area:2627}.\nThe Large Termite Mounds stand all over the hills east of {area:2627}. Use the {item:15042} on each mound you pass."] = "书躺在{area:2627}的废墟旅店里。\n大型白蚁丘遍布{area:2627}以东的山丘。经过每个蚁丘时使用{item:15042}。",
	["The crystal clusters stand all over the crater, many around {area:537}. Take a few extra of each colour for the pylons."] = "水晶簇遍布环形山，很多在{area:537}周围。每种颜色多采几块，留给能量塔。",
	["The doll's head and its two sides lie in the houses around {npc:10926}; join them from your bags."] = "洋娃娃的脑袋和两半身体在{npc:10926}周围的房子里；在背包里把它们拼起来。",
	["The expedition's crate sits at an abandoned camp in the eastern jungle."] = "远征队的箱子放在东部丛林一处废弃营地。",
	["The expedition's lost equipment lies in the south-west jungle."] = "考察队丢失的研究设备在西南丛林里。",
	["The gorillas live on the north-east plateau. Stay out of the deepest cave: {npc:9622} lives there."] = "猩猩住在东北高原。别进最深的洞穴：{npc:9622}住在那里。",
	["The mountain lets you out beside {area:252}, full of 55-57 orcs. Follow the road east along the northern cliffs to the Horde camp at {area:251}."] = "从山里出来就在{area:252}旁边，那里满是55-57级的兽人。沿北边悬崖的道路向东，前往部落营地{area:251}。",
	["The next guide starts here, at the chapel's flight master."] = "下一个指南从这里的教堂飞行管理员处开始。",
	["The pylon stands on the slope east of the refuge."] = "水晶塔在避难所东边的山坡上。",
	["The raft lies on the shore of the south-eastern lake; the small pack sits in the water beside it."] = "破碎的木筏在东南湖泊的岸边；小背包就在旁边的水里。",
	["The silithid hive fills the south of the crater. Gorishi wasps and workers drop the scent gland; use the Scraping Vial on the egg mass inside the first chamber. The Hive Queen at the bottom is an elite boss: stay out of her chamber. Pterrordax nest on the cliffs above the hive; their scales are for {npc:9998}."] = "异种虫巢穴占据了环形山南部。戈里希黄蜂和工蜂掉落气味腺；在第一个洞室的卵堆上使用刮取瓶。底层的蜂巢女王是精英首领：不要进她所在的洞室。翼手龙筑巢在虫巢上方的峭壁上；它们的鳞片是给{npc:9998}的。",
	["The tar pits lie just south of the refuge. Tar Beasts, Lurkers and Creepers drop the {item:11834}."] = "焦油坑就在避难所以南。焦油兽、潜伏者和爬行者掉落{item:11834}。",
	["Theodora's next errand goes to Lotwil east of town and then into {area:1584}: skip it."] = "西奥多拉的下一个任务要去找城东的洛特维尔，然后再进{area:1584}：跳过它。",
	["To {area:976}"] = "前往{area:976}",
	["Top up here to level 51.81 before the hand-ins at {area:16985}: they take you to level 52."] = "在{area:16985}交任务之前，先把等级补到51.81级：交完会到52级。",
	["Underwater"] = "水下",
	["Upstairs"] = "楼上",
	["Use the Mangled Journal to start it"] = "使用被撕破的日记开始任务",
	["Western Pylon"] = "西部水晶塔",
	["With {npc:11063}'s quest in your log, slain Scourge sometimes leave a {npc:11064}; talk to it to free it. Kill undead on the ride south-west to {area:2262}."] = "任务日志里有{npc:11063}的任务时，被杀死的天灾军团有时会留下一个{npc:11064}；和它交谈来释放它。在向西南骑往{area:2262}的路上击杀亡灵。",
	["Zaeldarr lurks just west of {area:2262}."] = "扎尔达潜伏在{area:2262}以西。",
	["grind on Pterrordax"] = "刷翼手龙",
	["grind on {npc:6509}"] = "刷{npc:6509}",
	["grind on {npc:6511}"] = "刷{npc:6511}",
	["grind on {npc:6551}"] = "刷{npc:6551}",
	["{area:139}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:139}：遇到这些就杀",
	["{area:250}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:250}：遇到这些就杀",
	["{area:2627}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:2627}：遇到这些就杀",
	["{area:272} flight master"] = "{area:272}飞行管理员",
	["{area:340} flight master"] = "{area:340}飞行管理员",
	["{area:490}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:490}：遇到这些就杀",
	["{area:538}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:538}：遇到这些就杀",
	["{item:11116}, a rare drop"] = "{item:11116}，稀有掉落",
	["{npc:10879}, the {object:36078}, beside the bat master"] = "{npc:10879}，在{object:36078}的蝙蝠管理员旁边",
	["{npc:10926}'s ghost stands in the ruins of {area:2262}, in the south-west."] = "{npc:10926}的鬼魂站在西南边{area:2262}的废墟里。",
	["{npc:5594}, inside"] = "{npc:5594}，在室内",
	["{npc:6522}, the {object:36073}"] = "{npc:6522}，在{object:36073}",
	["{npc:7825} stands in the {object:36082}."] = "{npc:7825}站在{object:36082}里。",
	["{npc:8390}, the Apothecarium: the vials fill in {zone:1447} later"] = "{npc:8390}，在炼金房：瓶子之后在{zone:1447}装满",
	["{npc:9117}, at the back of the cave; below ground"] = "{npc:9117}，在洞穴深处；地下",
	["{npc:9117}, below ground"] = "{npc:9117}，地下",
	["{npc:9618}, just outside"] = "{npc:9618}，就在外面",
	["{npc:9619} camps in the south-east corner of the crater."] = "{npc:9619}在环形山的东南角扎营。",
	["{npc:9623} then wants a {item:10561}, an {skill:202} item. Skip it unless you have one."] = "{npc:9623}接着要一个{item:10561}，那是{skill:202}物品。除非你已经有，否则跳过。",
	["{npc:9623}, the robot on the plateau; below ground"] = "{npc:9623}，高原上的机器人；地下",
	["{npc:9998}, at the entrance"] = "{npc:9998}，在入口",
	["{npc:9998}, at the refuge entrance"] = "{npc:9998}，在避难所入口",
	["{object:175894}, beside the house; inside"] = "{object:175894}，在小屋旁；室内",
	["{quest:3822} walks the caves and mine tunnels of {quest:3821}; if he isn't home, clear the ogres around the entrances until he comes back."] = "{quest:3822}在{quest:3821}的洞穴和矿道里走动；如果他不在，就清理入口周围的食人魔，直到他回来。",
	["{zone:1454} flight master"] = "{zone:1454}飞行管理员",
}

G["forever/horde/50-60/02-felwood"] = {
	["Angerclaw Grizzly"] = "怒爪灰熊",
	["Back north to {area:1763}. Fill {npc:10922}'s canteen at the corrupted moonwell in the middle of the southern camp."] = "向北回到{area:1763}。在南部营地中央被腐化的月亮井装满{npc:10922}的水壶。",
	["Below ground"] = "地下",
	["Careful: Den Watchers are level 53-54; they call nearby allies within 25 yd once below 50% health and run off for help below 15%."] = "小心：巢穴守卫是53-54级；血量低于50%后，它们会呼叫25码内的盟友，低于15%时会跑去求援。",
	["Class trainer"] = "职业训练师",
	["Deadwood Avenger"] = "枯木复仇者",
	["Deadwood Den Watcher"] = "枯木巢穴守卫",
	["Deadwood Gardener"] = "枯木园丁",
	["Deadwood Pathfinder"] = "枯木寻路者",
	["Deadwood Shaman"] = "枯木萨满",
	["Deadwood Warrior"] = "枯木战士",
	["Derrington's watchtowers, Vandis' cauldron and {npc:11615}'s barrel are done on a later visit: keep them."] = "德灵顿的哨塔、范蒂丝的瘟疫之锅和{npc:11615}的木桶留到之后再来时完成：留着它们。",
	["Diseased Grizzlies"] = "染病灰熊",
	["Diseased Grizzly"] = "染病灰熊",
	["Diseased Wolf"] = "染病狼",
	["Diseased Wolves"] = "生病的狼",
	["Druid trainer"] = "德鲁伊训练师",
	["East of Bloodvenom Post, the cratered vale where the Entropic Beasts and Horrors roam. Kill two of each, then walk to each of the three fel-water craters."] = "在血毒岗哨东边，是{npc:9878}和热能恐兽游荡的坑洼山谷。每种各杀两只，然后走到三个邪能水坑的每一个那里。",
	["Entropic Beast"] = "熵能野兽",
	["Entropic Horror"] = "熵能恐魔",
	["Felpaw Ravager"] = "魔爪蹂躏者",
	["Fly to {area:272}"] = "飞往{area:272}",
	["Fly to {area:431}"] = "飞往{area:431}",
	["Follow the road north-east to {area:1767}. The Warpwood Moss Flayers and Shredders on the east side of the woods each carry a {item:11503}; Angerclaw Grizzlies and Felpaw Ravagers roam the same woods for Talo."] = "沿道路向东北前往{area:1767}。树林东侧的曲木食苔者和曲木撕裂者各带着一块{item:11503}；怒爪灰熊和魔爪掠夺者在同一片树林里游荡，是塔罗要的。",
	["Follow the road north-west. The south of {area:1763}, around its corrupted moonwell, is held by Shadow Council cultists, adepts, guardsmen and their hounds."] = "沿道路向西北。{area:1763}南部那口被腐化的月亮井周围被暗影议会的加德纳尔祭司、加德纳尔精兵、卫兵和恶犬占据。",
	["He camps by the {area:202}, south-east of {area:200}."] = "他在{area:200}东南的{area:202}旁扎营。",
	["Inside"] = "里面",
	["Jadefire moonwell"] = "碧火月亮井",
	["Jaedenar Adept"] = "加德纳尔侍僧",
	["Jaedenar Cultist"] = "加德纳尔邪教徒",
	["Jaedenar Guardian"] = "加德纳尔守卫",
	["Jaedenar Hound"] = "加德纳尔猎犬",
	["Keep Little Pamela: Pamela is in {area:2262}, visited again later."] = "留着“小帕梅拉”：帕梅拉在{area:2262}，之后还会再来。",
	["Keep the branch: {npc:5770} is in {zone:1456}."] = "留着树枝：{npc:5770}在{zone:1456}。",
	["Keep {quest:5158}: {npc:5901} is in the {zone:1413}."] = "留着{quest:5158}：{npc:5901}在{zone:1413}。",
	["Keep {quest:8465} for {zone:1452}."] = "留着{quest:8465}去{zone:1452}。",
	["Knights and magi work the {area:192}; the medics and hunters camp south of it."] = "血色骑士和血色占星师在{area:192}干活；血色医护员和血色猎人在它南边扎营。",
	["Level 52.63"] = "52.63级",
	["Level 53.02"] = "53.02级",
	["Level 53.2"] = "53.2级",
	["Level 53.34"] = "53.34级",
	["Level 54.1"] = "54.1级",
	["Level 54.45"] = "54.45级",
	["Level 54.54"] = "54.54级",
	["Level 54.7"] = "54.7级",
	["Level 54.87"] = "54.87级",
	["Northern crater"] = "北部水坑",
	["On the way"] = "途中",
	["Only if a {item:13140} dropped: use it to start the quest, then free {npc:11018} in her cage in {area:1770}, the cave at the north end of {area:1763}, and escort her out."] = "仅当掉落了{item:13140}时：使用它开始任务，然后到{area:1763}北端的洞穴{area:1770}里，把笼子里的{npc:11018}救出来，并护送她出去。",
	["Only if you rescued {npc:11018}: the succubus {npc:9518} waits in the middle of {area:1763}, beside the {npc:11020}."] = "仅当你救出了{npc:11018}时：魅魔{npc:9518}在{area:1763}中部，就在{npc:11020}旁边等候。",
	["Only with 5 Deadwood Headdress Feathers"] = "仅当你有5根死木头饰羽毛时",
	["Paladin trainer"] = "圣骑士训练师",
	["Rakaiah"] = "拉凯亚",
	["Ride back south past {area:1763} to the corrupted moonwell of the Jadefire satyrs and fill {npc:9996}'s flasket there."] = "向南骑过{area:1763}，前往碧火萨特那口被腐化的月亮井，在那里装满{npc:9996}的小瓶。",
	["Ride north along the eastern hills; {npc:1855} lives in a small house by the {area:2619}, at the border with the {zone:1423}."] = "沿东边的山丘向北骑行；{npc:1855}住在{area:2619}旁的一间小房子里，就在与{zone:1423}的交界处。",
	["Ride north up the road again."] = "再次沿道路向北骑行。",
	["Ride north-west into Andorhal. {npc:10667} waits in the ruined inn on the west side of town; the skeletons inside are 54-57, so keep to the edges."] = "向西北骑进安多哈尔。{npc:10667}在城镇西侧被毁的旅店里等候；里面的骷髅是54-57级，所以沿着边缘走。",
	["Ride south past the {area:202} to {area:197}. Kill the Diseased Wolves you meet in the fields on the way."] = "骑马向南越过{area:202}前往{area:197}。途中的田野里遇到染病狼就杀掉。",
	["Ride south-west past Felstone Farm and follow the road west back to the {area:152}."] = "向西南骑过费尔斯通农场，沿道路向西回到{area:152}。",
	["Ride the road south through {area:361} to the Sanctuary."] = "沿路向南穿过{area:361}前往翡翠圣地。",
	["Ride west to the {area:192}; {npc:11610} hides on the hill north-east of it."] = "向西骑往{area:192}；{npc:11610}躲在它东北的山上。",
	["Ror stands at the far south end of {area:1761}."] = "洛尔站在{area:1761}最南端。",
	["Scarlet Crusade"] = "血色十字军",
	["Scarlet Hunter"] = "血色猎人",
	["Scarlet Knight"] = "血色骑士",
	["Scarlet Mage"] = "血色法师",
	["Scarlet Medic"] = "血色医师",
	["Southern crater"] = "南部水坑",
	["Southern {area:1763}"] = "{area:1763}南部",
	["Take the kitten to the same moonwell and release it there; once it has turned into a {npc:10042}, bring it back to {npc:9996} and click on it to hand it over."] = "把小猫带到同一口月亮井并在那里放出它；它变成{npc:10042}后，把它带回{npc:9996}那里，点击它交给她。",
	["The Annals lie among the Musty Tomes in Andorhal's town hall; open them until you find the right one."] = "达隆郡的历史就在安多哈尔市政厅里的发霉的书籍中间；一本本打开，直到找到正确的那本。",
	["The Deadwood furbolg village just west of the tunnel. {npc:9462} (56) stands among them. {npc:11557}, a friendly furbolg, sits at the north end of the village."] = "隧道正西的死木熊怪村庄。{npc:9462}（56级）站在它们中间。{npc:11557}是一个友善的熊怪，坐在村庄北端。",
	["The Deadwood furbolg village lies just south of the Sanctuary. Every Deadwood kill also raises your {area:1769} reputation; keep the headdress feathers."] = "死木熊怪的村庄就在翡翠圣地正南。每杀一个死木熊怪也会提升你在{area:1769}的声望；留着死木头饰羽毛。",
	["The Horde camp just north of {area:1763}."] = "{area:1763}正北的部落营地。",
	["The Jadefire moonwell"] = "碧火月亮井",
	["The bears roam the hills north and east of the {area:202}."] = "熊在{area:202}以北和以东的山丘上游荡。",
	["The diary lies in the farmhouse, the cabinet stands inside and the outhouse is behind it. A {npc:10816} carries the outhouse key; {npc:10836} comes out when you open the outhouse and carries the cabinet key."] = "日记在农舍里，柜子在屋里，厕所在屋后。一个{npc:10816}带着厕所钥匙；打开厕所时{npc:10836}会出来，他带着柜子钥匙。",
	["The druids' camp is just past the border."] = "德鲁伊的营地就在边界过去一点。",
	["The road ends at {npc:15395}, outside the {area:1769} tunnel in the far north-east."] = "道路的尽头是{npc:15395}，就在遥远东北的{area:1769}隧道外。",
	["The wolves roam the fields between Andorhal, {area:200} and the {area:202}. Finish them on the ride back east."] = "狼在安多哈尔、{area:200}和{area:202}之间的田野里游荡。向东骑回去的路上把它们杀完。",
