	["Pathstrider"] = "巡路者",
	["Plaguebat"] = "瘟疫蝙蝠",
	["Plaguehound"] = "瘟疫犬",
	["Plaguehound Runt"] = "瘟疫犬幼崽",
	["Plaguehound Runts and Plaguebats roam the hills north of the {area:2260}, Carrion Grubs crawl among them; work north toward {area:2627}."] = "瘟疫犬幼崽和瘟疫蝙蝠在{area:2260}以北的山丘游荡，腐肉蛆虫在其中爬行；一路向北推进到{area:2627}。",
	["Plaguehounds and their runts roam the shores of the lake south-west of the chapel.\nThe shattered sword lies on the ground north-west of the lake."] = "瘟疫犬和它们的幼崽在教堂西南的湖岸游荡。\n断裂的剑躺在湖西北的地上。",
	["Ranger"] = "游侠",
	["Ride east to {area:2255} and north out of it; the Moontouched Owlbeasts roam the hills of {area:2241}'s southern slopes. Pull them one at a time."] = "向东骑往{area:2255}，再从那里向北出去；月光枭兽在{area:2241}南坡的山丘上游荡。一次引一只。",
	["Ride west to the {area:2260}."] = "向西骑往{area:2260}。",
	["Sprinkle"] = "斯普林科",
	["The flight from {area:1997} lands in {zone:1456}: {npc:3033} (Druids) trains on {area:1639}, {npc:246344} (Paladins) in the city too."] = "从{area:1997}的航班降落在{zone:1456}：{npc:3033}（德鲁伊）在{area:1639}训练，{npc:246344}（圣骑士）也在城里。",
	["The high elf Rangers, Pathstriders and Woodsmen guard the lodge by {area:2275}; the Registry lies inside. Rangers reach 60: pull one at a time. Noxious Plaguebats fly over the fields on the way.\nThe skull sits in the {area:2622}, among Blighted Horrors and Plague Monstrosities."] = "高等精灵游侠、巡路者和林地守卫守着{area:2275}旁的旅店；登记册就在里面。游侠达到60级：一次拉一只。路上的田野上空有剧毒瘟疫蝙蝠飞过。\n头骨在{area:2622}，四周是枯萎恐怖和瘟疫畸变体。",
	["The {object:142071} machine"] = "{object:142071}机器",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:11897} is a level 60 elite: most classes solo it at level 62, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back."] = "这些是精英怪：建议组队，找个人一起做。{npc:11897}是60级精英：多数职业62级能单挑，但你可能需要帮忙。独自一人就跳过：路线会安排你刷回经验。",
	["Underwater"] = "水下",
	["Upstairs"] = "楼上",
	["Use {item:12928} on {npc:7583}, the goblin girl in {area:976}. {npc:10977} and {npc:10978} are scared later in the route."] = "对{area:976}的地精女孩{npc:7583}使用{item:12928}。{npc:10977}和{npc:10978}在路线后段会被吓跑。",
	["Woodsman"] = "林地守卫",
	["Zeppelin to {zone:1454}"] = "乘飞艇到{zone:1454}",
	["{area:2255} flight master"] = "{area:2255}飞行管理员",
	["{area:2268} flight master"] = "{area:2268}飞行管理员",
	["{area:2277}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:2277}：遇到这些就杀",
	["{area:272} flight master"] = "{area:272}飞行管理员",
	["{area:976} flight master"] = "{area:976}飞行管理员",
	["{item:13853} on the way"] = "路上用{item:13853}",
	["{item:15447} spoils within ten minutes: kill the town's Scourge quickly and grind the seven pieces with the {item:15454} at once.\nCareful: Unseen Servants call for help within 25 yd once they drop to 40% health. Out of combat they also turn invisible with {spell:10228}. If a call for help happens inside the town, a large number of mobs can join the fight. Fighting near the outskirts lowers this risk."] = "{item:15447}十分钟内就会腐烂：尽快杀掉镇里的天灾，同时用{item:15454}一次刷齐七块碎片。\n小心：隐形仆从在生命降到40%后会向25码内的同伴呼救。战斗外它们还会用{spell:10228}隐形。如果在镇子内部发生呼救，可能会有大量怪物加入战斗。在外围附近作战能降低这个风险。",
	["{npc:10778}'s farm is the first one east of the {area:152}. Jabbering Ghouls on the farm carry the other half of her charm; {npc:11075} guards the cauldron in the field.\nCareful: One or two undead usually fight alongside him, and more cauldron lords can attack after you use the cauldron."] = "{npc:10778}的农场是{area:152}以东的第一座农场。农场里的呓语食尸鬼带着她符咒的另一半；{npc:11075}守着田里的大锅。\n小心：通常有一两只亡灵和他一起战斗，你使用大锅后还可能有更多大锅领主来袭。",
	["{npc:11140} the ghost stands by a hut in {area:2627}, in the north-west corner."] = "鬼魂{npc:11140}站在西北角{area:2627}的一间小屋旁。",
	["{npc:11558} walks around here: look inside the circle on the map"] = "{npc:11558}在这里一带走动：看地图圆圈内",
	["{npc:15193}'s champion holds the {area:2260} farmhouse, north of the {area:2261}."] = "{npc:15193}的勇士占据{area:2260}的农舍，在{area:2261}以北。",
	["{npc:3033} on {area:1639}; {npc:246344}"] = "{area:1639}的{npc:3033}；{npc:246344}",
	["{npc:7771} camps by the {area:1336} road, south of {area:976}."] = "{npc:7771}在{area:976}南边通往{area:1336}的路旁扎营。",
	["{npc:8565} walks around {area:2276}: look inside the circle on the map"] = "{npc:8565}在{area:2276}一带走动：看地图圆圈内",
	["{npc:8600} on the way"] = "路上找{npc:8600}",
	["{npc:9299} is a ghost at the graveyard just north of {area:976}; the Conspicuous Gravestone is south of it, outside the town wall."] = "{npc:9299}是{area:976}正北墓地里的一个鬼魂；明显的墓碑在它南边、城墙外面。",
	["{quest:3914} goes back to Linken in Un'Goro: keep it."] = "{quest:3914}要交还给安戈洛的林克：留着它。",
	["{quest:5086} are in {zone:1448}, on a later trip: keep it if you have it."] = "{quest:5086}在{zone:1448}，之后那一趟再去：如果你有就留着。",
	["{quest:5168}'s items lie in the later Plaguelands zones: keep it."] = "{quest:5168}要的物品在之后的瘟疫之地地区：留着它。",
	["{zone:1423}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{zone:1423}：遇到这些就杀",
	["{zone:1454} flight master"] = "{zone:1454}飞行管理员",
	["{zone:1456} flight master"] = "{zone:1456}飞行管理员",
}

G["forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus"] = {
	["A torn scroll lies at the entrance of the {area:2261}, the crypt south of the {area:2260}."] = "一张撕裂的卷轴在{area:2261}入口处，那是{area:2260}以南的墓穴。",
	["Andorhal Tower Four"] = "安多哈尔塔楼四",
	["Andorhal Tower One"] = "安多哈尔塔楼一",
	["Andorhal Tower Three"] = "安多哈尔塔楼三",
	["Andorhal Tower Two"] = "安多哈尔塔楼二",
	["Andorhal watchtowers and silos"] = "安多哈尔的哨塔和粮仓",
	["Back to Southwind and climb the tower. Stirring the hive at the top brings out Hive'Ashi Ambushers; one carries the {item:17346}."] = "回到南风村，爬上塔。搅动塔顶的虫巢会引出亚什伏击者；其中一个携带{item:17346}。",
	["Back to {area:3425}"] = "返回{area:3425}",
	["Below ground"] = "地下",
	["Careful: Ghouls and skeletons usually stand next to the boxes and attack when you come close. Searing ghouls also hurt anyone nearby and will break stealth."] = "小心：食尸鬼和骷髅通常站在箱子旁，你一靠近就会攻击。灼热食尸鬼还会伤害周围的人，并会打破潜行。",
	["Careful: Un'Goro Gorillas (level 50-51) call for help from allies within 20 yd once they drop to 25% health. There is a cave full of apes in the area, and fighting there brings many adds."] = "小心：安戈洛猩猩（50-51级）在生命降到25%后会向20码内的同伴呼救。这一带有个满是猩猩的洞穴，在那里打会引来很多额外的怪。",
	["Cavalier Durgen"] = "骑士杜尔根",
	["Class trainer"] = "职业训练师",
	["Collie is inside it."] = "科利在里面。",
	["Dithers offers {quest:964} ({quest:838}). Skip it."] = "迪瑟斯会给{quest:964}（{quest:838}）。跳过它。",
	["Dredge Crusher"] = "挖掘碾压者",
	["Dredge Crushers and Pincers"] = "掘泥摧毁者和巨钳蝎",
	["Dredge Striker"] = "挖掘打击者",
	["Dredge Strikers, Stonelash Scorpids and Sand Skitterers share the sands just north of the hold."] = "挖掘打击者、石鞭蝎和沙地爬行者共享要塞以北的沙地。",
	["East along the road, {npc:11077} guards the cauldron at {area:200}."] = "沿道路向东，{npc:11077}守着{area:200}的瘟疫之锅。",
	["Escort {npc:9999}"] = "护送{npc:9999}",
	["Flayers and Rock Stalkers"] = "石鞭掠夺者和石行蜘蛛",
	["Fly to {area:1637}"] = "飞往{area:1637}",
	["Fly to {area:541}"] = "飞往{area:541}",
	["Fly to {area:976}. The {object:142071} stands in the middle of town."] = "飞往{area:976}。{object:142071}立在镇中央。",
	["Frankal Stonebridge"] = "弗兰克尔·石桥",
	["Frenzied Pterrordax"] = "狂乱的翼手龙",
	["Hameya hides among the Mossflayer trolls of {area:2273}, in the north-east corner.\nCareful: The trolls along the path to {area:2273} are level 57-59. They run away at low health and call for help, so they often bring adds with them."] = "哈米亚藏在{area:2273}东北角的苔藓剥皮者巨魔中。\n小心：通往{area:2273}路上的巨魔是57-59级。他们低血量时会逃跑并呼救，所以常常带来额外的怪。",
	["Hameya's mound"] = "哈米亚的坟堆",
	["Hameya's scroll"] = "哈米亚的卷轴",
	["Head north along the western dunes; Dredge Crushers and Stonelash Pincers range from here back toward the hold."] = "沿西部沙丘向北；掘泥摧毁者和石鞭巨钳蝎分布在从这里到要塞的一带。",
	["Huntsman Radley"] = "猎人拉德利",
	["If you skipped {quest:6135}, grind here to level 59.14 to stay on the route's plan."] = "如果你跳过了{quest:6135}，就在这里刷到59.14级，以符合路线安排。",
	["Inside"] = "室内",
	["Into {area:139}"] = "进入{area:139}",
	["Into {area:28}"] = "进入{area:28}",
	["Keep the bait: {npc:9684} is level 56, and the second loop passes his lair."] = "留着诱饵：{npc:9684}是56级，第二轮会经过它的巢穴。",
	["Keep {quest:3942}: {npc:9116} is at the {area:2479}, on the next guide's way through {zone:1448}."] = "留着{quest:3942}：{npc:9116}在{area:2479}，下一篇指南会经过{zone:1448}。",
	["Lead {npc:9999} north to {area:541}. When he faints, use {item:11804} on him to wake him."] = "把{npc:9999}向北引到{area:541}。他昏倒时，对他使用{item:11804}把他唤醒。",
	["Level 59.14"] = "59.14级",
	["Mar'alith's {quest:8304} needs level 58 and leads into {area:2744} among elites. Skip it."] = "玛拉利斯的{quest:8304}需要58级，会带你进入精英遍布的{area:2744}。跳过它。",
	["Mark {npc:10902} with the {item:12815}"] = "用{item:12815}标记{npc:10902}",
	["Mark {npc:10903} with the {item:12815}"] = "用{item:12815}标记{npc:10903}",
	["Mark {npc:10904} with the {item:12815}"] = "用{item:12815}标记{npc:10904}",
	["Mark {npc:10905} with the {item:12815}"] = "用{item:12815}标记{npc:10905}",
	["North to the lumber camp; set the termite barrel down in the middle of the mill."] = "向北前往伐木场；把白蚁桶放在锯木厂中央。",
	["Paladin trainer"] = "圣骑士训练师",
	["Pamela and the {area:2261}"] = "帕米拉与{area:2261}",
	["Pterrordax"] = "翼手龙",
	["Quixxil"] = "奎克希尔",
	["Radley and Durgen"] = "拉德利与杜尔根",
	["Ride east to {area:537}, climb it and use {npc:10541} at the lava vent near the top, then ride back west to {npc:10302}."] = "向东骑到{area:537}，爬上去，在山顶附近的熔岩口使用{npc:10541}，然后向西骑回{npc:10302}处。",
	["Ride east to {npc:1855}'s hut by the {area:2619} and hear him out."] = "向东骑往{area:2619}旁{npc:1855}的小屋，听他把话说完。",
	["Ride north-east to {area:3077}; you leave {zone:1451} through the pass beside it."] = "向东北骑往{area:3077}；你从旁边的山口离开{zone:1451}。",
	["Ride north-east to {area:3447}."] = "向东北骑往{area:3447}。",
	["Ride north-west to {npc:1855}'s hut."] = "向西北骑往{npc:1855}的小屋。",
	["Ride south into Andorhal. {npc:10667} waits in the ruined inn on the west side of town. Stand in the doorway of each of the four towers with the {item:12815} to mark it; keep to the edges of town. Use the {item:12627} by the silos in the middle of town to bring out Temporal Parasites."] = "向南骑进安多哈尔。{npc:10667}在城镇西侧被毁的旅店里等候。拿着{item:12815}站在四座塔的每一个门口来标记它；沿城镇边缘走。在镇中央的粮仓旁使用{item:12627}引出时光寄生虫。",
	["Ride south-east to {area:3447} under the Un'Goro cliffs."] = "向东南骑往安戈洛悬崖下的{area:3447}。",
	["Ride south-west to the ruins of {area:2738}. The {object:179565} for {npc:11801} sits inside one of the ruined houses."] = "向西南骑往{area:2738}的废墟。给{npc:11801}的{object:179565}在其中一座毁坏的房子里。",
	["Ride south-west to {npc:10667} in Andorhal."] = "向西南骑往安多哈尔的{npc:10667}那里。",
	["Ride to {area:2262} in the south-west; Pamela plays among the houses. {npc:11886} lurks in the {area:2261}, the crypt just west of the town.\nCareful: About four non-elite adds come with Mercutio. They walk to the grave instead of appearing on the spot."] = "骑到西南的{area:2262}；帕米拉在房屋间玩耍。{npc:11886}潜伏在{area:2261}，也就是镇子西边的墓穴。\n小心：大约四只非精英怪会跟着墨丘利一起来。它们是走到墓前，而不是原地出现。",
	["Ride west to the Horde camp north of {area:2744}."] = "向西骑往{area:2744}北边的部落营地。",
	["Ride west to the walled hold in the middle of the desert. {npc:15189} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "向西骑到沙漠中央有围墙的要塞。{npc:15189}站在他屋子的楼上：从里面上楼，箭头分不清楼层。",
	["Rutgar Glyphshaper"] = "鲁特加·雕文者",
	["Scourge Champions"] = "天灾勇士",
	["Scourge Champions roam the {area:2270}, north of the chapel. Pass {npc:11063}'s {item:13156} over each one you kill: the skulls that resonate are the ones he wants."] = "天灾勇士在教堂北边的{area:2270}游荡。在你杀死的每一个身上晃一晃{npc:11063}的{item:13156}：产生共鸣的头骨就是他要的。",
	["Silithyst geysers erupt across the southern desert. Walk into the Silithyst one leaves behind and carry it to the Horde's Silithyst Extractor at Kirika's camp; fighting or mounting drops it."] = "水晶尘喷泉在南部沙漠各处喷发。走进喷泉留下的水晶尘，把它带到吉里卡营地的部落水晶尘提取器；战斗或骑上坐骑都会让它掉落。",
	["Stonelash Flayers and Rock Stalkers roam the dunes south-west of Kirika's camp."] = "石鞭掠夺者和石行蜘蛛在吉里卡营地西南的沙丘上游荡。",
	["Temporal Parasite"] = "时空寄生虫",
	["The glowing tablet fragments lie around the Twilight camp in the far north-west; the Dust Stormers and Desert Rumblers there drop them too."] = "发光的石板碎片散落在最西北的暮光营地周围；那里的尘暴者和沙漠轰鸣者也会掉落。",
	["The libram lies further north, on the way to {area:190}."] = "圣契在更北边，通往{area:190}的路上。",
	["The pass from Un'Goro comes out at {area:3077}, the graveyard in north-east {zone:1451}. {npc:13220} stands among the graves."] = "从安戈洛环形山出来的山口通往{area:3077}，那是{zone:1451}东北部的墓地。{npc:13220}站在坟墓之间。",
	["The satchel lies in the mountains of the far south, past Bronzebeard's Encampment. Deathclasp, an elite scorpid, patrols near it: grab it while he is away."] = "诺格的背包在遥远南方的山里，过了铜须营地。精英蝎子死亡弯钩在附近巡逻：趁它走开时拿走背包。",
	["The shield lies at {area:201}, south of {npc:1855}'s hut."] = "盾牌在{npc:1855}小屋南边的{area:201}。",
	["The spare texts from the cultists"] = "信徒身上多出来的密文信",
	["The wooden sign beside {npc:9997}"] = "{npc:9997}旁的木牌",
	["The {object:177675} is just behind the {area:2261}."] = "{object:177675}就在{area:2261}后面。",
	["Through the pass and east along the northern cliffs to {area:541}. {npc:8737} stands by the cave; J.D."] = "穿过山口，沿北侧峭壁向东到{area:541}。{npc:8737}站在洞穴旁；J.D.",
	["Tortured Druid"] = "受折磨的德鲁伊",
	["Tortured Sentinel"] = "受折磨的哨兵",
	["Twilight Vanguard"] = "暮光先锋军营地",
	["Underwater"] = "水下",
	["Upstairs"] = "楼上",
	["Use {npc:10980} on {npc:10977}"] = "对{npc:10977}使用{npc:10980}",
	["West to the {area:152}. The next guide starts in the {zone:1458}, a short ride west."] = "向西前往{area:152}。下一个指南从西边不远的{zone:1458}开始。",
	["Zeppelin to {zone:1458}"] = "乘飞艇到{zone:1458}",
	["grind on {npc:10717}"] = "刷{npc:10717}",
	["{area:1099} flight master"] = "{area:1099}飞行管理员",
	["{area:190}'s Scarlets are level 58-60. Ride in to the high point marked on your map, look over the town, and get out.\nCareful: Sentinels posted at the gate can detect stealthed players. Additional sentinels are found within the town, and an elite walks a patrol route nearby."] = "{area:190}的血色成员是58-60级。骑到地图上标记的高点，俯瞰镇子，然后离开。\n小心：门前的哨兵能发现潜行玩家。镇内还有更多哨兵，附近有一个精英在巡逻。",
	["{area:490}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:490}：遇到这些就杀",
	["{area:976} flight master"] = "{area:976}飞行管理员",
	["{item:20375} on the way"] = "路上用{item:20375}",
	["{item:20377} from {npc:11739}, 130 yd south-west"] = "{item:20377}来自{npc:11739}，西南130码",
	["{npc:10302} sends you to {npc:9298} in {zone:1452}: keep it."] = "{npc:10302}派你去找{zone:1452}的{npc:9298}：留着。",
	["{npc:10302} the goblin sits at {area:543}, just east of the pylon."] = "地精{npc:10302}坐在{area:543}，就在能量塔以东。",
	["{npc:10667}'s Battle of Darrowshire ends against elites. Skip it."] = "{npc:10667}的达隆郡之战最后要对付精英。跳过它。",
	["{npc:10667}, upstairs"] = "{npc:10667}，楼上",
	["{npc:11613} stands east of the lumber camp; {npc:11611} guards the road north-east of {npc:11610}, toward {area:190}.\nCareful: Guards stand at the tower's base and one more circles it on patrol. Clear them before you engage Durgen so they don't join the fight."] = "{npc:11613}站在伐木场东边；{npc:11611}守着{npc:11610}东北通往{area:190}的路。\n小心：塔底有卫兵，还有一个绕着塔巡逻。和杜尔根交战前先清掉他们，免得他们加入战斗。",
	["{npc:11741} walks around {area:2738}: look inside the circle on the map"] = "{npc:11741}在{area:2738}一带走动：看地图圆圈内",
	["{npc:11803} walks the Vanguard camp in the far south-west. Every cultist here drops Encrypted Twilight Texts, quest or not: collect twenty, ten for {npc:15306} and ten for Ortell."] = "{npc:11803}在遥远西南的暮光先锋军营地里走动。这里的每个信徒都会掉落暮光密文信，不管你有没有任务：收集二十份，十份给{npc:15306}，十份给奥泰尔。",
	["{npc:11804} stands in the outpost west of {area:3425}. Top your Encrypted Twilight Texts up to twenty on the cultists here."] = "{npc:11804}站在{area:3425}西边的前哨站里。在这里的信徒身上把暮光密文信补到二十份。",
	["{npc:15189} and {npc:15190} stand upstairs in their building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "{npc:15189}和{npc:15190}站在他们屋子的楼上：从里面上楼，箭头分不清楼层。",
	["{npc:15189} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "{npc:15189}站在他屋子的楼上：从里面上楼，箭头分不清楼层。",
	["{npc:15190} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "{npc:15190}站在他屋子的楼上：从里面上楼，箭头分不清楼层。",
	["{npc:15200} holds the camp in the west."] = "{npc:15200}占据着西边的营地。",
	["{npc:15306}, on the west side of the Hold"] = "{npc:15306}，在要塞西侧",
	["{npc:246344} in {zone:1456}; {zone:1454} has no paladin trainer"] = "{npc:246344}在{zone:1456}；{zone:1454}没有圣骑士训练师",
	["{npc:9117}, below ground"] = "{npc:9117}，地下",
	["{npc:9167} walks around here: look inside the circle on the map"] = "{npc:9167}在这里一带走动：看地图圆圈内",
	["{npc:9619} now asks for {npc:9622}'s pelt, back in the north-east cave: skip it."] = "{npc:9619}现在要{npc:9622}的毛皮，就在东北的洞穴里：跳过它。",
	["{npc:9684}'s lair is just south of the pylon. Use {npc:9619}'s bait there; {npc:9684} is level 56 and hits hard, so start at full health."] = "{npc:9684}的巢穴就在能量塔以南。在那里用{npc:9619}的诱饵；{npc:9684}是56级，打得狠，所以满血再上。",
	["{npc:9999} sits on the ridge, lost and exhausted."] = "{npc:9999}坐在山脊上，迷了路又筋疲力尽。",
	["{zone:1451}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{zone:1451}：遇到这些就杀",
}

G["forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood"] = {
	["Any Winterfall furbolg can carry the beads; the camps just south of {npc:11556} are the closest."] = "任何冬泉熊怪都可能携带念珠；{npc:11556}正南边的营地离得最近。",
	["Back into the Timbermaw tunnel and take the {area:618} exit; {npc:9298} camps by the hot springs just outside."] = "回到木喉隧道，从{area:618}方向的出口出去；{npc:9298}就守在出口外的温泉旁。",
	["Back south to the Sanctuary, a short ride."] = "向南回到翡翠圣地，路程很短。",
	["Below ground"] = "地下",
	["Class trainer"] = "职业训练师",
	["Dungeon instead of grinding"] = "用地下城代替刷怪",
	["Fly to {area:431}"] = "飞往{area:431}",
	["Fly to {area:431} and ride north-west along the road out of {zone:1440} into {area:361}. The {area:2479} is the druids' camp just past the border."] = "飞往{area:431}，沿离开{zone:1440}的路向西北骑行进入{area:361}。{area:2479}就是刚过边界处的德鲁伊营地。",
	["From Krakle in Un'Goro"] = "从安戈洛的克拉克尔那里",
	["From the {zone:1458}, take the zeppelin from the tower outside the city to {zone:1454}."] = "从{zone:1458}城外的塔楼乘飞艇前往{zone:1454}。",
	["Frostfire Winterfall camp"] = "霜火温泉的冬泉营地",
	["Grind to 60"] = "刷到60级",
	["In {zone:1454}: fly from {area:2255}"] = "在{zone:1454}：从{area:2255}飞过去",
	["In {zone:1456}: fly from {area:2255}"] = "在{zone:1456}：从{area:2255}飞过去",
	["Legacki"] = "莱加基",
	["Level 59.54"] = "59.54级",
	["Level 59.9"] = "59.9级",
	["Moora"] = "穆拉",
	["Only if you carry {quest:5087}: the runners walk the road from {area:1769} toward {area:2244} in small groups; wait by the road near {npc:9298} and kill them as they pass. Each one carries a crate.\nCareful: Turning in spawns three or four level 56-57 Winterfall ambushers that attack you; you can escape them while mounted, in stealth or with {spell:5384}, and they then gather by the lake so you can take the next quest."] = "只有带着{quest:5087}时才做：信使会成小队从{area:1769}沿路走向{area:2244}；在{npc:9298}附近的路边等着，经过时杀掉。每个信使都带着一个箱子。\n小心：交任务会刷出三到四个56-57级的冬泉伏击者攻击你；可以骑马、潜行或用{spell:5384}逃脱，之后它们会聚集在湖边，方便你接下个任务。",
	["Only if {npc:9298} gave you {quest:5086}: ride north up the {area:361} road to {area:1767}; the {quest:5086} ooze between the trees."] = "只有{npc:9298}给了你{quest:5086}时才做：沿{area:361}的路向北骑到{area:1767}；树丛间游荡着{quest:5086}软泥怪。",
	["Only with 30 {quest:6031}, and only at Neutral with the Timbermaw: follow the road north to {area:1769}; {npc:11557} trades just inside the entrance."] = "仅当你有30块{quest:6031}，且木喉要塞声望达到中立时：沿道路向北前往{area:1769}；{npc:11557}就在入口里面交易。",
	["Optional. Running {area:2279}, {area:2057}, Lower Blackrock Spire or {area:1584} with a group instead of grinding gets you there faster."] = "可选。和队伍一起刷{area:2279}、{area:2057}、黑石塔下层或{area:1584}，代替刷怪能更快到达。",
	["Optional: with a group, a 55-60 dungeon replaces the grind below."] = "可选：有队伍时，用一个55-60级的地下城代替下面的刷怪。",
	["Ride back west to {area:2246}."] = "骑马向西回到{area:2246}。",
	["Ride east along the road to {area:2255}."] = "沿道路向东骑往{area:2255}。",
	["Ride east, then south down {area:2249}. The Frostmaul giants there are elite level 59: keep to the middle and keep moving. The strange source is at the mouth of {area:2256}, at the south end."] = "向东骑，再沿{area:2249}向南。那里的霜槌巨人是59级精英：靠中间走，保持移动。奇怪的源头在{area:2256}入口、南端。",
	["Ride north along the road, past {area:1763}, to {area:1997}."] = "沿道路向北骑行，经过{area:1763}，前往{area:1997}。",
	["Ride north-west to {area:1763}. The four braziers stand among the Shadow Council's buildings; use the Cleansed Water on each one.\nCareful: Shadow Council mobs of level 53-55 fill the cave and often come in large linked groups, many with stuns. A group of 2-3 players is recommended."] = "向西北骑到{area:1763}。四个火盆立在暗影议会的建筑之间；对每个火盆使用净化之水。\n小心：洞里到处是53-55级的暗影议会怪物，常常成群联动，很多会眩晕。建议2-3人组队。",
	["Salia"] = "萨莉亚",
	["South to the Sanctuary once more."] = "再次向南前往翡翠圣地。",
	["The quests run out here. Rabid Shardtooths prowl {area:2249} in southern {area:618}, south of the road from {area:2255}."] = "这里的任务到头了。狂乱的碎齿熊在{area:618}南部的{area:2249}出没，位于{area:2255}道路以南。",
	["The {area:2479}"] = "{area:2479}营地",
	["Through the Timbermaw tunnel to {area:493}. {npc:11939} reads in a house in {area:2361}."] = "穿过木喉隧道前往{area:493}。{npc:11939}在{area:2361}的一间屋子里读书。",
	["Top up here to level 59.54 before the hand-ins at {area:1997} : they take you to level 60."] = "先在这里补到59.54级，再去{area:1997}交任务：这些任务会把你带到60级。",
	["Top up here to level 59.9 before the hand-ins at {area:618}: they take you to level 60."] = "先在这里补到59.9级，再去{area:618}交任务：这些任务会把你带到60级。",
	["Zeppelin to {zone:1454}"] = "乘飞艇前往{zone:1454}",
	["grind on {npc:7441}"] = "刷{npc:7441}",
	["grind on {npc:7446} at {area:2249}, {area:618}"] = "在{area:2249}、{area:618}刷{npc:7446}",
	["sixty {item:14047}, if you carry them"] = "六十个{item:14047}（如果你带着的话）",
	["{npc:10306}'s next {quest:4741} would bring you back here from {area:618}. Skip it."] = "{npc:10306}的下一个{quest:4741}会让你从{area:618}再回到这里。跳过它。",
	["{npc:11558}, at the tunnel mouth; walks around here: look inside the circle on the map"] = "{npc:11558}，在隧道口；在这一带走动：看地图上的圆圈里",
	["{npc:11801}'s Shards of the Felvine needs {area:2577}. Skip it."] = "{npc:11801}的魔藤碎片需要{area:2577}。跳过它。",
	["{npc:11939} walks around {area:2361}: look inside the circle on the map"] = "{npc:11939}在{area:2361}附近走动：看地图上的圆圈里",
	["{npc:9116}'s Silver Heart needs an {item:11173} from northern {area:361} and a ride back here. Skip it."] = "{npc:9116}的银色之心需要一块来自{area:361}北部的{item:11173}，还要再骑回这里。跳过它。",
	["{npc:9116}, inside"] = "{npc:9116}，在里面",
	["{npc:9298} next sends you after {npc:10738}, an elite in his cave. Skip it."] = "{npc:9298}接下来让你去对付{npc:10738}，他是洞穴里的精英。跳过它。",
	["{npc:9861}, {npc:9860} and {npc:9517} wait at the back of {area:1770}, the cave in {area:1763}'s north. Clear the tunnel as you go.\nCareful: The three bosses fight as a group. Kill the nearby mobs first so you don't pull extra enemies."] = "{npc:9861}、{npc:9860}和{npc:9517}守在{area:1770}深处，也就是{area:1763}北面的洞穴。边走边清隧道。\n小心：三个首领是一起战斗的。先杀掉附近的怪，免得拉来更多敌人。",
	["{zone:1454} flight master"] = "{zone:1454}的飞行管理员",
}

G["forever/horde/orc/01-durotar"] = {
	["Armored Scorpid"] = "装甲蝎子",
	["Armored Scorpids crawl over the plains west of {area:362}. Tame one, then return to {npc:3171}."] = "{npc:3126}在{area:362}西边的平原上爬行。驯服一只，然后返回{npc:3171}处。",
	["Back east to the shore north of {npc:275657}. Spitelash Scouts and Attendants hold the beach below {area:370}. Hunters: tame a {npc:3107} on the beach."] = "向东回到{npc:275657}北边的海岸。{npc:275662}和其他恶鞭纳迦占据着{area:370}下方的海滩。猎人：在海滩上驯服一只{npc:3107}。",
	["Back south to {area:362}."] = "向南返回{area:362}。",
	["Back to the Den"] = "返回洞穴",
	["Back to {area:14}"] = "回到{area:14}",
	["Back to {area:362}."] = "返回{area:362}。",
	["Back to {npc:5875} in the {object:172960}. Use the {item:7464} on the summoning circle there and defeat the voidwalker to bind it."] = "回到{object:172960}找{npc:5875}。在那里的召唤法阵上使用{item:7464}，击败虚空行者以束缚它。",
	["Below ground"] = "地下",
	["Burning Blade cultists hold the caves of {quest:827}; any of them drops a {item:4871}. {npc:3204}, a level 14 warlock, stands deep inside and drops the {item:4903}."] = "火刃氏族祭司占据着{quest:827}的洞穴；任何一个都会掉落{item:4871}。{npc:3204}是14级术士，站在洞穴深处，掉落{item:4903}。",
	["Class trainer"] = "职业训练师",
	["Deathskip to Northern Durotar"] = "死亡跳过到北杜隆塔尔",
	["Deathskip to {area:367}"] = "死亡跳过到{area:367}",
	["Die to the mobs at 52.0,21.4 ({npc:3118}): a death there sends you to this graveyard. Release your spirit and take the {npc:6491}'s resurrection."] = "在52.0,21.4（{npc:3118}）处死在怪物手里：在那里死亡会把你送到这个墓地。释放灵魂，接受{npc:6491}的复活。",
	["Die to the mobs at 66.9,87.2 ({npc:3206}): a death there sends you to this graveyard. Release your spirit and take the {npc:6491}'s resurrection."] = "在66.9,87.2（{npc:3206}）处死在怪物手里：在那里死亡会把你送到这个墓地。释放灵魂，接受{npc:6491}的复活。",
	["Dire Mottled Boar"] = "凶暴杂斑野猪",
	["Druid trainer"] = "德鲁伊训练师",
	["Dustwind Savage"] = "尘风野蛮人",
	["Dustwind Storm Witch"] = "尘风风暴女巫",
	["Felstalkers roam the slope below the cave, on the valley's north side."] = "地狱捕猎者在山谷北侧、洞穴下方的山坡上游荡。",
	["Follow the road north from {area:362} to {zone:1454}'s main gate, just west of {area:817}. {npc:3352} stands with the hunter trainers in the {object:172958}."] = "沿道路从{area:362}向北到{zone:1454}的正门，就在{area:817}西边。{npc:3352}和猎人训练师一起站在{object:172958}。",
	["Follow the road west from {area:362} over the {area:814} bridge; {area:379} sits just above it on the {area:17} side."] = "从{area:362}沿路向西，过{area:814}桥；{area:379}就在桥上方{area:17}那一侧。",
	["Follow the road west from {area:362} over the {area:814} bridge; {npc:5810} stands at {area:379}, just above it on the {area:17} side."] = "从{area:362}沿路向西，过{area:814}桥；{npc:5810}站在{area:379}，就在桥上方{area:17}那一侧。",
	["Free {npc:275811} and see her safely out of the crag"] = "救出{npc:275811}，护送她安全离开峭壁",
	["Head north-east to the road toward {zone:1454}. {npc:3293} camps beside it; the stolen sacks lie along the road south of him."] = "向东北到通往{zone:1454}的路上。{npc:3293}在路边扎营；被偷的麻袋散落在他以南的路边。",
	["Head south through the isles. The Loa idols lie all over the southern isles; Voodoo and Hexed Trolls hold them and drop the Hexed Pendants. {quest:826} and Minshina's cage are on the southernmost isle."] = "向南穿过群岛。被遗忘的洛阿神像散落在南部各岛；巫毒巨魔和{npc:3207}守着它们，并掉落{item:275724}。{quest:826}和明希纳的笼子在最南边的岛上。",
	["Hexed Troll"] = "妖术巨魔",
	["Inside"] = "里面",
	["Inside the cave, go straight on at the first split, then right and follow the stream on your left to the waterfall: the pick glows by the water, behind a column of rock."] = "进入洞穴后，在第一个岔口直走，然后右转，沿左手边的溪流走到瀑布：镐在水边、一根石柱后面发光。",
	["Inside the cave, keep to the right wall all the way round, over the stream: {npc:3183} waits at the end."] = "进入洞穴后，一直沿右侧洞壁绕行，越过溪流：{npc:3183}在尽头等候。",
	["Into {zone:1454}"] = "进入{zone:1454}",
	["Kul Tiras Marine"] = "库尔提拉斯陆战队员",
	["Kul Tiras Sailor"] = "库尔提拉斯水手",
	["Lazy Peon"] = "懒惰的苦工",
	["Level 10"] = "10级",
	["Lieutenant Benedict"] = "本尼迪克特中尉",
	["Mage trainer"] = "法师训练师",
	["Makrura and surf crawlers line the beaches north-east of Sen'jin.\nThe gnomish toolboxes lie in the wreckage along the shore east and south-east of {area:362}. Follow the shore south to Sen'jin."] = "龙虾人和冲浪蟹分布在森金东北的海滩上。\n侏儒工具箱在{area:362}以东和东南沿岸的残骸里。沿海岸向南到森金。",
	["Misha's hut stands south of the lizards. The crocolisks along the {area:814} to the west carry {item:4891}."] = "米莎·托克伦的小屋在蜥蜴南边。西边{area:814}沿岸的鳄鱼带着{item:4891}。",
	["Mottled Boar"] = "杂斑野猪",
	["On the way"] = "途中",
	["Paladin trainer"] = "圣骑士训练师",
	["Prickly pears"] = "仙人掌果",
	["Quilboars and scouts hold the huts west of town; dustrunners and battleguards hold the camps farther west."] = "钢鬃野猪人和钢鬃斥候占据着镇子西边的小屋；钢鬃传令兵和钢鬃卫兵占据着更西边的营地。",
	["Razormane Battleguard"] = "钢鬃战斗守卫",
	["Razormane Dustrunner"] = "钢鬃奔尘者",
	["Razormane Quilboar"] = "钢鬃野猪人",
	["Razormane Scout"] = "钢鬃斥候",
	["Ridgeshade Creeper"] = "脊影爬行者",
	["Ridgeshade Lurker"] = "脊影潜伏者",
	["Savages and Storm Witches nest in {area:370}, east of {npc:3293}. A Storm Witch drops the {item:277661}. Shamans: the Burning Blade Cultists by {area:371}, at the ravine's south end, drop the {item:6652}."] = "野蛮人和风暴女巫盘踞在{npc:3293}以东的{area:370}。风暴女巫会掉{item:277661}。萨满注意：峡谷南端{area:371}旁的火刃教徒掉{item:6652}。",
	["Spitelash naga"] = "恶鞭纳迦",
	["Summoned Voidwalker"] = "召唤的虚空行者",
	["Surf Crawler"] = "冲浪蟹",
	["Tame it with the {item:15908}"] = "用{item:15908}驯服它",
	["The keep stands on the coast south-east of {area:362}. The raiders' axe, bow and shield lie on its outskirts. Sailors and marines drop the {item:4870}. {npc:3192} waits at the top of the keep; his key opens the chest beside him, which holds the {item:4881}."] = "城堡位于{area:362}东南方的海岸上。袭击者的斧头、弓和盾牌在城堡外围。库尔提拉斯水手和库尔提拉斯水兵掉落{item:4870}。{npc:3192}在城堡顶层等候；他的钥匙能打开他旁边的箱子，里面有{item:4881}。",
	["The prickly pears grow among the quilboar huts just west of town."] = "仙人掌果生长在镇子西边的野猪人小屋之间。",
	["The weapons lie around the Den and the training grounds; the Mottled Boars roam the whole valley floor."] = "被遗弃的训练武器散落在洞穴和训练场周围；{npc:3098}在整个山谷谷底游荡。",
	["The {object:58595} stands in {area:817}, among the cultists you just fought."] = "{object:58595}在{area:817}，就在你刚才对付的祭司中间。",
	["Thunder Lizards and Lightning Hides graze on {area:369} across the bridge; any of them can drop a {item:6486}."] = "{npc:3130}和{npc:3131}在桥对面的{area:369}上吃草；任何一只都可能掉落{item:6486}。",
	["Thunder Lizards and Lightning Hides graze on {area:369}, just west and south-west of {npc:3293}.\nFizzle holds the Burning Blade camp on {area:369}, north-west of {area:362}. Hunters: tame a {npc:3099} with the {item:15908} on the way.\nCareful: Burning Blade cultists surround Fizzle, some linked so they aggro in pairs, and they respawn quickly."] = "雷霆蜥蜴和闪电皮蜥蜴在{npc:3293}正西和西南的{area:369}吃草。\n菲兹尔占据着{area:362}西北{area:369}上的火刃营地。猎人注意：途中用{item:15908}驯服一只{npc:3099}。\n注意：火刃教徒围着菲兹尔，有些是联动的会成对仇恨，而且刷新很快。",
	["Thunder lizards across the river"] = "河对岸的雷霆蜥蜴",
	["Top up here to level 10: {quest:840}, at {area:362}, needs level 10."] = "在这里补到10级：{area:362}的{quest:840}需要10级。",
	["Training weapons and boars"] = "训练武器和野猪",
	["Underwater"] = "水下",
	["Upstairs"] = "楼上",
	["Vile Familiar"] = "邪恶小鬼",
	["Voodoo Troll"] = "巫毒巨魔",
	["Wade across to the northern Echo Isle. The Matriarch prowls among the raptors there.\nWade back west to the shore south of Sen'jin. Durotar Tigers roam it and the Taillasher eggs sit in nests along the beach."] = "涉水到北边的回音群岛。女族长在那里的一群迅猛龙中游荡。\n再涉水向西回到森金以南的海岸。杜隆塔尔虎在那里游荡，尾鞭蛇的蛋在沿滩的巢里。",
	["Wake {quest:5441} with the {item:16114}"] = "用{item:16114}叫醒{quest:5441}",
	["West over the {area:814} bridge, past {area:379} and on along the ridge: {npc:5907} stands alone above the Razormane camp."] = "向西过{area:814}桥，经过{area:379}沿山脊继续走：{npc:5907}独自站在钢鬃营地之上。",
	["While you're here: learn Staves from {npc:2704} ({object:172958}, 10 silver); a Hunter's melee weapon is mostly its stats, and two-handers carry the most."] = "在这里时：找{npc:2704}（{object:172958}，10银）学习法杖；猎人的近战武器主要看属性，双手武器属性最多。",
	["While you're here: learn Staves from {npc:2704} ({object:172958}, 10 silver); a staff carries more spell stats than a one-hander while you level."] = "在这里时：找{npc:2704}（{object:172958}，10银）学习法杖；升级期间法杖比单手武器提供更多法术属性。",
	["grind on {npc:3111}"] = "刷{npc:3111}",
	["the {object:654925} on the ground beside her"] = "她身旁地上的{object:654925}",
	["{area:363}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:363}：遇到就杀",
	["{area:366} lies west of Sen'jin. The three attack plans sit on the ground among the centaur tents. {npc:275811} is held at the crag as well."] = "{area:366}在森金村西边。三份进攻计划在半人马帐篷之间的地上。{npc:275811}也被关押在峭壁。",
	["{area:368}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:368}：遇到就杀",
