	["Aanders and the fallen guards are just south-west of the tower. Take Raani's feather and the Shadowsong signet from the bodies."] = "天空祭司安德斯和阵亡的卫兵就在塔的西南方。从尸体上取得拉尼的幸运羽毛和影歌家族徽记。",
	["Al'Aketh Assassin"] = "奥阿克刺客",
