	["Hungry Bandit"] = "饥饿的强盗",
	["Innkeeper {npc:255940}, by the west gate"] = "旅店老板{npc:255940}，在西门旁",
	["Into {area:17}"] = "进入{area:17}",
	["Into {zone:1412}"] = "进入{zone:1412}",
	["Jump off the top of the watchtower and use {spell:1259416} to float down to {npc:251361}, west of the tower."] = "从瞭望塔顶跳下，使用{spell:1259416}飘落到塔西的{npc:251361}处。",
	["Juvenile Vuldren"] = "幼年鹫龙",
	["Leave {zone:2521} to {zone:1412}"] = "离开{zone:2521}前往{zone:1412}",
	["Leaving {area:16635}"] = "离开{area:16635}",
	["Listen to {npc:252448}'s story"] = "听{npc:252448}讲述他的故事",
	["Listen to {npc:256083}"] = "听{npc:256083}说话",
	["Living Lightning"] = "活体闪电",
	["Malduko Cloudcrush"] = "马尔杜科·碎云",
	["Naaleos Leafwhisper"] = "纳里奥斯·叶语",
	["Northern {zone:1412}"] = "{zone:1412}北部",
	["On the way"] = "顺路",
	["On your way north from Valennia, {npc:255853} waits by the falls north-east of you, just north of the {area:17675}: from the ridge above them, glide down with {spell:1259416}."] = "从瓦伦尼亚向北走的路上，{npc:255853}在你东北方的瀑布旁等你，就在{area:17675}以北：从瀑布上方的山脊用{spell:1259416}滑翔下去。",
	["Ornery Galestrider"] = "暴躁的疾风行者",
	["Pesky Cirrusflies and {npc:250873} roam the grove just south-east of the village."] = "烦人的卷云蝇和{npc:250873}在村子东南方的林地里游荡。",
	["Pesky Cirrusfly"] = "讨厌的卷云蝇",
	["Portal to {area:16630}"] = "通往{area:16630}的传送门",
	["Prideclaws and Galestriders share the meadows south of {area:16624}. The Galestriders drop both the Small Eggs and the {item:5469} for {npc:251905}."] = "傲爪兽和疾风行者共享{area:16624}南边的草甸。疾风行者既掉落小蛋，也掉落{npc:251905}要的{item:5469}。",
	["Raw Windstones"] = "原始风石",
	["Roiling Winds"] = "翻腾之风",
	["Shen'dar bounty board"] = "杉达尔悬赏板",
	["Sit by {npc:263664}'s campfire (type /sit) until you get the {spell:1229451} buff, then learn {skill:185} from {npc:251905} at the cook fire."] = "坐在{npc:263664}的篝火旁（输入/sit），直到获得{spell:1229451}增益，然后在炊火旁找{npc:251905}学习{skill:185}。",
	["Skyhopper"] = "跳天者",
	["Skyhoppers"] = "{npc:251727}",
	["Skyhoppers hop about the fields just west of Valennia."] = "{npc:251727}在瓦伦妮亚·风暴之拳西边的田野里蹦跳。",
	["Skypriest Aanders"] = "天空祭司安德斯",
	["Spread the {item:278078} off {area:1641}"] = "在{area:1641}散播{item:278078}",
	["Stormapples and flutterfly dust lie all over the orchard; Hungry Bandits raid it. Galestriders graze in the fields east of it. The broken construct floats at the orchard's north edge."] = "成熟的风暴苹果和扑翼蝶鳞粉散落在果园各处；{npc:252802}在果园里抢劫。疾风陆行鸟在果园东边的田野里吃草。损坏的构造体漂浮在果园北缘。",
	["Take the Portal to {area:16630} in the shrine up to the heights. Fight east along the ledge to the Peacekeepers at its end, ride the wind current up to the upper terrace and tell {npc:252475} you are ready. Leave the {object:617084} up there alone until Rohash has withdrawn; then it takes you straight back to town."] = "在神龛处乘坐通往{area:16630}的传送门上到高地。沿山脊向东杀到尽头的和平卫士处，乘气流上到上层平台，告诉{npc:252475}你准备好了。Rohash撤退之前别碰上面的{object:617084}；之后它会直接把你带回城镇。",
	["Take {item:277267} to {npc:268592} at the Shrine of Flames, south-west of {area:16638}, then head west into the {area:16623}: {npc:268605}'s home is in the hills south of the Windsong Crawlers' lakes."] = "把{item:277267}带给{area:16638}西南火焰神龛的{npc:268592}，然后向西进入{area:16623}：{npc:268605}的家在风歌爬行者湖泊以南的丘陵中。",
	["Tame {npc:250874}"] = "驯服{npc:250874}",
	["Tame {npc:251707}"] = "驯服{npc:251707}",
	["Tame {npc:254588}"] = "驯服{npc:254588}",
	["Tell {npc:252800} you're ready"] = "告诉{npc:252800}你已准备就绪",
	["The Al'Aketh camp"] = "奥拉凯斯营地",
	["The Enchanted Gyrozephyrs lie under water far to the north, east of {area:16624} and south-west of {area:16625}."] = "魔化旋风机在遥远北方的水下，位于{area:16624}以东、{area:16625}西南。",
	["The Highwayman Bandits hold the hills north of {area:16663}; they drop the Blood-Stained Bandit Masks."] = "拦路强盗盘踞在{area:16663}北边的丘陵；他们掉落血渍强盗面具。",
	["The Raw Windstones are blue crystals on the slopes around the village."] = "原始风石是村子周围山坡上的蓝色水晶。",
	["The apprentices practise north-east of the village.\nThe bandit camps are north-east of the village; \"Badwind\" Bennic holds the top camp. Bandits carry the stolen windstones."] = "学徒们在村子东北方练习。\n强盗营地在村子东北方；“恶风”本尼克占据最上面的营地。强盗们带着被盗的风石。",
	["The hermit lives at {area:16625}'s west shore. {item:257128} cones grow south of him; the Wind Hollows drift east of the lake and also drop the Wind Hollow Essences for {npc:254344}'s {quest:93736}."] = "隐士住在{area:16625}的西岸。{item:257128}的球果生长在他南边；风穴怪在湖东飘荡，也掉落{npc:254344}的{quest:93736}所需的风穴精华。",
	["The hippogryph nests are north-west of the {area:17674}, west of {quest:92529}. The Matriarch sits at their western end; {item:263493} lies on the ground around the nests."] = "角鹰兽巢穴在{area:17674}西北、{quest:92529}以西。女族长坐镇巢穴西端；{item:263493}散落在巢穴周围的地面上。",
	["The orchard"] = "果园",
	["The queen hovers at the south-east end of the grove, on your way back from the stones."] = "卷云蝇后在林地东南端盘旋，就在你从立石返回的路上。",
	["The refugees' belongings lie along the north shore of {area:16625}; {npc:259013} is at its north-west end."] = "难民的物品散落在{area:16625}北岸；{npc:259013}在湖的西北端。",
	["The standing stones"] = "立石",
	["The turncoat"] = "叛徒",
	["The turncoat's house is in the {area:16626} north-west of {area:16638}. {npc:273017} waits nearby; his assassins lurk around the house."] = "叛徒的房子在{area:16638}西北方的{area:16626}。{npc:273017}在附近等候；他的刺客潜伏在房子周围。",
	["The {area:16629}"] = "{area:16629}",
	["The {area:16629} is north of {area:16638}. Fight through the guards up to {npc:253576} at its east side."] = "{area:16629}在{area:16638}北边。一路击败卫兵，到其东侧找{npc:253576}。",
	["The {area:17674}"] = "{area:17674}",
	["The {area:17675}"] = "{area:17675}",
	["The {item:260881} lies in a cave in the hills north-west of {npc:256083}."] = "{item:260881}在{npc:256083}西北丘陵的一个山洞里。",
	["The {object:148418}"] = "{object:148418}",
	["Underwater"] = "水下",
	["Upstairs"] = "楼上",
	["Ur'endra"] = "乌恩德拉",
	["Ursera Scavenger"] = "乌尔瑟拉食腐者",
	["Use the {item:278078} at the ceremonial mat and burner on the south-facing cliff of {area:1641}."] = "在{area:1641}朝南的悬崖上，于仪式垫和香炉处使用{item:278078}。",
	["Vuldren Alpha"] = "鹫龙头领",
	["Warlock trainer"] = "术士训练师",
	["While you're here: learn Staves from {npc:11869} (10 silver); a Hunter's melee weapon is mostly its stats, and two-handers carry the most."] = "趁在这里：找{npc:11869}学习法杖（10银）；猎人的近战武器主要看属性，双手武器属性最高。",
	["While you're here: learn {spell:199} from {npc:11869} (10 silver); two-handers level a Warrior fastest."] = "趁在这里：找{npc:11869}学习{spell:199}（10银）；双手武器让战士练级最快。",
	["Wind Hollow"] = "风穴怪",
	["Windsong Crawler"] = "风歌爬行者",
	["You leave the isle for good. {npc:259119} waits where the airship lands."] = "你将永远离开这座岛。{npc:259119}在飞艇降落处等候。",
	["You wake in {area:16635}, in the north of the isle. {npc:251362} stands by the path, {npc:251361} at the village centre."] = "你在岛屿北部的{area:16635}醒来。{npc:251362}站在小路旁，{npc:251361}在村子中央。",
	["drink the {item:6635} at the {area:16988}, just east of the village, to see the {npc:251166}"] = "在村子正东的{area:16988}喝下{item:6635}，即可看见{npc:251166}",
	["search the dead cultist in the house"] = "搜查房子里死去的教徒",
	["search the wardrobe"] = "搜查衣柜",
