	["{npc:2127} in {zone:1420}; {area:16638} has no warlock trainer"] = "{npc:2127}在{zone:1420}；{area:16638}没有术士训练师",
	["{npc:249363} stands at the {area:17678}, east of the village. {npc:251143} and Al'Aketh Converts gather just north of her. The {object:460001} is just north-east of her: cast your {spell:1259686} racial ability next to it."] = "{npc:249363}站在村子东边的{area:17678}。{npc:251143}和奥阿克皈依者聚集在她北边。{object:460001}就在她东北方：在它旁边施放你的种族技能{spell:1259686}。",
	["{npc:250926} prowl the slopes south-west of the village, on the way to {npc:252095}.\nThe Ursera den is west of the village. {npc:251115}, their matriarch, sits at its far end."] = "{npc:250926}在村子西南的山坡上游荡，就在去{npc:252095}的路上。\n乌尔瑟拉巢穴在村子西边。它们的女族长{npc:251115}坐镇巢穴最深处。",
	["{npc:251361}'s errands"] = "{npc:251361}的差事",
	["{npc:251361}: a note from your trainer"] = "{npc:251361}：训练师给你的便条",
	["{npc:251361}: examine the {item:282418}"] = "{npc:251361}：查看{item:282418}",
	["{npc:251361}: read the {item:9547}"] = "{npc:251361}：阅读{item:9547}",
	["{npc:251361}: the {item:4100}"] = "{npc:251361}：{item:4100}",
	["{npc:251373}, the druid trainer, on the ground floor of the tree behind {npc:251361}"] = "{npc:251373}，德鲁伊训练师，在{npc:251361}身后那棵树的底层",
	["{npc:251374}, beside {npc:251361}"] = "{npc:251374}，在{npc:251361}旁",
	["{npc:251374}: {npc:5873} and your {item:5175}"] = "{npc:251374}：{npc:5873}和你的{item:5175}",
	["{npc:251376}, beside {npc:251361}"] = "{npc:251376}，在{npc:251361}旁",
	["{npc:251389}, in the watchtower"] = "{npc:251389}，在瞭望塔里",
	["{npc:251523} waits in {area:16624} for what you found in the wardrobe."] = "{npc:251523}在{area:16624}等着你在衣柜里找到的东西。",
	["{npc:251905}, {npc:251906}, {npc:251991}, {npc:252172} and {npc:251523} all stand in {area:16624}. If you are still short of {item:5469}, the Galestriders graze just south of the village."] = "{npc:251905}、{npc:251906}、{npc:251991}、{npc:252172}和{npc:251523}都在{area:16624}。如果{item:5469}还不够，疾风行者就在村子南边吃草。",
	["{npc:251905}: Camping 101 asks you to learn it"] = "{npc:251905}：“露营入门”要求你学会它",
	["{npc:251964}, in the watchtower"] = "{npc:251964}，在瞭望塔里",
	["{npc:251968} sends you on to Kalimdor. Once you have trained, board the skycutter at the dock on {area:16638}'s south-west edge: it flies to northern {zone:1412}, where {npc:259119} waits."] = "{npc:251968}送你前往卡利姆多。训练完毕后，在{area:16638}西南边缘的码头登上飞空艇：它飞往{zone:1412}北部，{npc:259119}在那里等你。",
	["{npc:252095} waits in {area:16622}, south-west of the village. The Al'Aketh camp is just beyond her; {npc:256935} leads it.\nCareful: {npc:256935} casts shocks; drag him clear of the other cultists before fighting so they don't join in."] = "{npc:252095}在村子西南的{area:16622}等你。奥阿克营地就在她前方；由{npc:256935}率领。\n注意：{npc:256935}会施放震击法术；开战前把他拉离其他信徒，以免它们加入战斗。",
	["{npc:252359} stands on {area:16638}'s east side. {npc:255853} waits by the falls just north of the {area:17675}: leave town to the north, climb the ridge east of the road and glide down to him with {spell:1259416}."] = "{npc:252359}站在{area:16638}东侧。{npc:255853}在{area:17675}正北的瀑布旁等你：从北边出城，爬上道路东侧的山脊，用{spell:1259416}滑翔下去找他。",
	["{npc:252377} stands beside {npc:256083}, just north-west of {area:16638}."] = "{npc:252377}站在{npc:256083}旁边，就在{area:16638}西北。",
	["{npc:252377}, beside {npc:256083}: {quest:94003}"] = "{npc:252377}，在{npc:256083}旁：{quest:94003}",
	["{npc:252382}, beside {npc:251968}: {quest:97243}"] = "{npc:252382}，在{npc:251968}旁：{quest:97243}",
	["{npc:252382}: {npc:2523}, your {item:5176} and the {item:263412}"] = "{npc:252382}：{npc:2523}、你的{item:5176}和{item:263412}",
	["{npc:252383}, upstairs"] = "{npc:252383}，在楼上",
	["{npc:252389} takes back the first {item:15908} and hands you two more, one at a time: Ornery Galestriders and Vuldren Alphas roam the fields just north of her. Tame each with its rod and bring the rod back to her. {npc:254411}, beside her, teaches {spell:5149}."] = "{npc:252389}收回第一根{item:15908}，再逐一交给你两根：暴躁的疾风行者和鹫龙头领就在她北边的田野上游荡。用对应的驯兽棒驯服每只，再把驯兽棒带回给她。她旁边的{npc:254411}教授{spell:5149}。",
	["{npc:252389}, a few steps west of {npc:257006}: {quest:94978}, the first rod"] = "{npc:252389}，在{npc:257006}西边几步：{quest:94978}，第一根驯兽棒",
	["{npc:252448} and {npc:256083}"] = "{npc:252448}和{npc:256083}",
	["{npc:252476}, upstairs"] = "{npc:252476}，在楼上",
	["{npc:252802} along the way to {npc:252800}"] = "{npc:252802}，在去{npc:252800}的路上",
	["{npc:253372}, inside"] = "{npc:253372}，室内",
	["{npc:253590}, upstairs"] = "{npc:253590}，在楼上",
	["{npc:253622}, {npc:258130} and {npc:258134} are in the cult camp east of {npc:257944}. {npc:254151} stands at its edge. Haalien also drops a {quest:94490}: read it to start the next quest. For {quest:94489}, enter the Nightfang Den, heal 7 injured druids and find {npc:258130}."] = "{npc:253622}、{npc:258130}和{npc:258134}在{npc:257944} Thornpaw东边的教派营地里。{npc:254151}站在营地边缘。Haalien还会掉落{quest:94490}：阅读它开始下一个任务。完成{quest:94489}：进入Nightfang Den，治疗7名受伤的德鲁伊并找到{npc:258130}。",
	["{npc:254344}, beside {npc:251968}"] = "{npc:254344}，在{npc:251968}旁",
	["{npc:254589} lurks south of the village, among the Prideclaws. {npc:254589} is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "{npc:254589}潜伏在村子南边的傲爪之间。{npc:254589}是精英：建议组队。",
	["{npc:256083} stands in the {area:16626} just north-west of town."] = "{npc:256083}站在城镇西北方的{area:16626}。",
	["{npc:256247} waits on the road north of {area:16638}, towards the {area:16629}."] = "{npc:256247} Brightwish在{area:16638}北边、通往{area:16629}的路上等候。",
	["{npc:257006} and {npc:252448}"] = "{npc:257006}和{npc:252448}",
	["{npc:257006} waits inside a house on {area:16638}'s western edge; {npc:252448} is close by."] = "{npc:257006}在{area:16638}西缘的一所房子里等你；{npc:252448}就在附近。",
	["{npc:257006}, inside"] = "{npc:257006}，室内",
	["{npc:257196} holds the {item:263993} on the west side of the shrine."] = "{npc:257196}在神殿西侧守着{item:263993}。",
	["{npc:257554} and {npc:263113} stand at the top of the watchtower, a few steps north-east of {npc:251368}."] = "{npc:257554}和{npc:263113}站在瞭望塔顶层，就在{npc:251368}东北边几步远处。",
	["{npc:257944} again"] = "再次找{npc:257944} Thornpaw",
	["{npc:257944}, last time"] = "最后一次找{npc:257944}",
	["{npc:258443} has her lair in a cave in the bluffs just south of the turncoat's house, where the {area:16623} meet the {area:16626}."] = "{npc:258443}的巢穴在叛徒房子正南的峭壁洞穴里，那里是{area:16623}与{area:16626}的交界处。",
	["{npc:259118}, by the landing: for {npc:3033} in {zone:1456}"] = "{npc:259118}，在降落处旁：交给{zone:1456}的{npc:3033}",
	["{npc:259119}: keep it, Thrall in {zone:1454} comes two guides later"] = "{npc:259119}：先留着，两份指南后到{zone:1454}交给萨尔",
	["{npc:263664}'s campfire"] = "{npc:263664}的营火",
	["{npc:268592}, at the Shrine of Flames just south-east of the orchard"] = "{npc:268592}，在果园东南的火焰神龛",
	["{npc:268602}, on the hill west of the falls just north of the watchtower"] = "{npc:268602}，在瞭望塔正北瀑布西边的小山上",
	["{npc:269068} wants tauren incense: buy its four parts from {npc:3014} the herbalist, {npc:3012} the enchanting supplier, {npc:3005} the leatherworking supplier and {npc:3027} the cooking supplier, then combine them into {item:278078}."] = "{npc:269068}想要牛头人熏香：从草药商{npc:3014}、附魔供应商{npc:3012}、制皮供应商{npc:3005}和烹饪供应商{npc:3027}处购买四种材料，然后合成{item:278078}。",
	["{npc:3033} trains druids on {area:1639}. He teaches you {spell:18960}; {npc:11802}'s welcome waits for your {spell:499} trip at about 23 (forever/horde/04-the-barrens)."] = "{npc:3033}在{area:1639}训练德鲁伊。他教你{spell:18960}；{npc:11802}的任务等你23级左右用{spell:499}旅行时再去拜访（forever/horde/04-the-barrens）。",
	["{npc:3449}: the harpies come later, in the {area:383}"] = "{npc:3449}：鹰身人稍后才会遇到，在{area:383}",
	["{quest:92529} lies south of Shen'dar. {npc:257065} meets you at its edge; search the wardrobe in the house behind him."] = "{quest:92529}在申达尔村南边。{npc:257065}在村边与你会合；搜查他身后房子里的衣柜。",
}

G["forever/horde/tauren/01-mulgore"] = {
	["/sit by Kaga's campfire until you get {spell:1229451}"] = "在卡加的篝火旁 /坐下，直到获得{spell:1229451}",
	["Adult Plainstrider"] = "成年平原陆行鸟",
	["Back east to {area:358}: the Bristleback Shamans stand among the quilboar there."] = "向东返回{area:358}：{npc:2953}站在那里的野猪人中间。",
	["Back south-east to the {area:396}."] = "向东南返回{area:396}。",
	["Back to {area:17}"] = "回到{area:17}",
	["Back to {npc:5888} in the camp. The {npc:5891} waits on the mesa east of the camp: drink the {item:6635} there to see it, then take the {item:6656} back to the Seer."] = "回到营地找{npc:5888}。{npc:5891}在营地东边的台地上等候：在那里喝下{item:6635}以看到它，然后把{item:6656}带回给先知。",
	["Back west to the camp."] = "向西返回营地。",
	["Battleboars graze north of the shrine; the Bristleback quilboar hold the ravine to the north-east. {npc:8554} stands at its eastern end, and the {object:3076} lies on the ground in the camp."] = "斗猪在神龛北边吃草；刺背野猪人占据着东北方的峡谷。{npc:8554}站在峡谷东端，{object:3076}在营地的地上。",
	["Below ground"] = "地下",
	["Bristleback Interloper"] = "刺背闯入者",
	["Cast {spell:18960}. {npc:11802} is in {area:2361}; the {quest:5930} sits in the north-western woods. {npc:11802} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "施放{spell:18960}。{npc:11802}在{area:2361}；{quest:5930}位于西北的树林里。{npc:11802}站在他住处的楼上：从里面上楼，箭头分不清楼层。",
	["Class trainer"] = "职业训练师",
	["Class turn-in in {area:1638}"] = "在{area:1638}交职业任务",
	["Cross north-west past {zone:1456} to the {area:398} in the far north of {zone:1412}."] = "向西北经过{zone:1456}，到{zone:1412}最北边的{area:398}。",
	["Cross to {area:1639}."] = "前往{area:1639}。",
	["Deathskip to {area:220}"] = "用死亡跳过路程到{area:220}",
	["Die to the mobs at 63.7,78.4 ({npc:2954}): a death there sends you to this graveyard. Release your spirit and take the {npc:6491}'s resurrection."] = "在坐标63.7,78.4处被怪杀死（{npc:2954}）：在那里死亡会把你送到这个墓地。释放灵魂，接受{npc:6491}的复活。",
	["Follow the path south out of camp to the Seer's tent at the foot of the hills."] = "沿小路向南离开营地，到山脚下灰舌先知的帐篷。",
	["Follow the road north out of {area:220}. {npc:265810} waits on the road just south of {area:222}; /sit by her campfire until you get {spell:1229451}."] = "沿路向北离开{area:220}。{npc:265810}在{area:222}正南方的路边等着；在她篝火旁 /坐下，直到获得{spell:1229451}。",
	["Galak Centaur"] = "加拉尔半人马",
	["Galak Outrunner"] = "加拉尔奔袭者",
	["Galak centaurs"] = "加拉克半人马",
	["Head north to {area:225}, east of {zone:1456}. {npc:3233} stands at the foot of the rocks; the Bristleback Interlopers dig at the burial ground and the {npc:2994} waits on top."] = "向北到{zone:1456}东边的{area:225}。{npc:3233}站在岩石脚下；{npc:3232}在墓地里挖掘，{npc:2994}在顶上等候。",
	["Inside"] = "里面",
	["Into {area:17}"] = "进入{area:17}",
	["Into {zone:1412}"] = "进入{zone:1412}",
	["Leave {zone:1412} by the south-eastern pass and follow the road to the {area:380}. {quest:860} stands by the inn, {npc:3448} at the south gate. {area:17} guide starts here.\n{area:380} is your base for this guide. Everyone you need stands within a few steps of the inn."] = "从东南山口离开{zone:1412}，沿路前往{area:380}。{quest:860}在旅店旁，{npc:3448}在南门。{area:17}的指南从这里开始。\n{area:380}是本指南的据点。你需要找的人都站在旅店附近几步之内。",
	["On the way"] = "途中",
	["Palemane Poacher"] = "苍白鬃毛偷猎者",
	["Palemane Skinner"] = "苍白鬃毛剥皮者",
	["Palemane Tanner"] = "苍白鬃毛鞣革工",
	["Prairie Stalker"] = "草原潜伏者",
	["Prairie Wolf Alphas roam among the wolves on the plains around {npc:275789} and the Galak camp to the east."] = "草原狼前锋在{npc:275789}和东边加拉克营地周围的平原上，混在狼群中游荡。",
	["Prairie Wolves and Adult Plainstriders roam the plains around the village."] = "草原狼和{npc:2956}在村子周围的平原上游荡。",
	["Ride a lift up to the mesas. {npc:2995} keeps the wind riders on the central rise; {npc:3057} stands in the great tent there."] = "乘升降梯上到台地。{npc:2995}在中央台地照看双足飞龙；{npc:3057}站在那里的大帐篷里。",
	["Rogue trainer"] = "盗贼训练师",
	["Spread the {item:278078} off {area:1641}"] = "在{area:1641}散播{item:278078}",
	["Swoop"] = "俯冲者",
	["Swoops glide over the plains all around Bloodhoof."] = "猛鹫在血蹄村周围的平原上空滑翔。",
	["Tame it with the {item:15908}"] = "用{item:15908}驯服它",
	["The Galak centaurs camp on the plains east of the well; {npc:275767} leads them."] = "加拉克半人马在水井东边的平原上扎营；{npc:275767}是他们的首领。",
	["The Palemane gnolls hold {area:818}, south of the digsite and west of Bloodhoof. {npc:272203} is held in their camp: lead him out."] = "白鬃豺狼人占据着挖掘场南边、血蹄村西边的{area:818}。{npc:272203}被关在他们的营地里：带他出来。",
	["The Windfury harpies hold {area:819}, north and west of the well."] = "风怒鹰身人占据着水井北边和西边的{area:819}。",
	["The dwarves of the {area:404} carry the Prospector's Picks. Smash them at the dwarves' forge in the digsite."] = "{area:404}的矮人带着勘察员的锄头。在挖掘场里矮人的熔炉上砸碎它们。",
	["The goblins work the mine in the hills north-east of the well. {quest:765} stands in the back of the mine; his {item:281031} start {quest:98424}, and the other pages lie inside the mine."] = "地精在水井东北方的山丘里开矿。{quest:765}站在矿洞深处；他的{item:281031}开始{quest:98424}，其余几页在矿洞里。",
	["The incense burns out in ten minutes: run straight east along the southern hills to the {object:660739}."] = "熏香十分钟就会燃尽：沿南边的山丘一直向东跑到{object:660739}。",
	["The shrine of An'she and Mu'sha"] = "安瑟与Mu'sha的神龛",
	["The stone stands in the pass out of {zone:1412}, on your way east. Use the {item:15710} there and defeat Lunaclaw."] = "石头在离开{zone:1412}的山口里，就在你向东的路上。在那里使用{item:15710}并击败月爪枭兽。",
	["The well lies north of the village. Well Stones sit around the well, {object:2912} lies under the trees nearby. Kill wolves, cougars, plainstriders and swoops on the way for {quest:766} and {quest:761}; the plainstriders also drop the {item:287505} for Kyle."] = "水井在村子北边。井石散落在井周围，{object:2912}在附近的树下。沿路杀狼、美洲狮、平原陆行鸟和俯冲者，用于{quest:766}和{quest:761}；平原陆行鸟还会掉落给凯尔的{item:287505}。",
	["The well lies south-east of the village."] = "水井在村子东南方。",
	["The wrecked caravan lies north-west of the centaurs, east of the road to {zone:1456}."] = "被毁的商队在半人马西北方、通往{zone:1456}的道路东边。",
	["The {object:177525}"] = "{object:177525}",
	["Use the {item:278078} at the ceremonial mat and burner on the south-facing cliff of {area:1641}."] = "在{area:1641}朝南的悬崖上，于仪式垫和香炉处使用{item:278078}。",
	["Venture Co. Supervisor"] = "风险投资公司监工",
	["Venture Co. Worker"] = "风险投资公司工人",
	["Warlock trainer"] = "术士训练师",
	["While you're here: learn Staves from {npc:11869} (10 silver); a Hunter's melee weapon is mostly its stats, and two-handers carry the most."] = "顺路：向{npc:11869}学习法杖（10银）；猎人的近战武器主要看属性，双手武器提供的属性最多。",
	["While you're here: learn {spell:199} from {npc:11869} (10 silver); two-handers level a Warrior fastest."] = "顺路：向{npc:11869}学习{spell:199}（10银）；战士用双手武器升级最快。",
	["You start on the mesa of {area:221}. {npc:2980} and the chief stand by the big tent in the middle."] = "你从{area:221}的台地上出发。{npc:2980}和鹰风酋长站在中央的大帐篷旁。",
	["{area:220}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:220}：遇到就杀",
	["{area:474}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:474}：遇到就杀",
	["{item:278079}, from {npc:3014}"] = "{item:278079}，来自{npc:3014}",
	["{item:278080}, from {npc:3012}"] = "{item:278080}，来自{npc:3012}",
	["{item:278081}, from {npc:3005}"] = "{item:278081}，来自{npc:3005}",
	["{item:278083}, from {npc:3027}"] = "{item:278083}，来自{npc:3027}",
	["{item:4703}, at the digsite forge"] = "{item:4703}，在挖掘场的熔炉旁",
	["{item:4739} along the way to {npc:2980}"] = "去{npc:2980}的路上{item:4739}",
	["{item:4740} along the way to {npc:2980}"] = "去{npc:2980}的路上{item:4740}",
	["{item:4848} along the way to {area:221}"] = "去{area:221}的路上{item:4848}",
	["{item:4849} along the way to {area:221}"] = "去{area:221}的路上{item:4849}",
	["{item:5203}: Flatland Prowlers roam the plains around {area:225}"] = "{item:5203}：平原徘徊者在{area:225}周围的平原上游荡",
	["{npc:269068} wants tauren incense: buy its four parts from {npc:3014} the herbalist, {npc:3012} the enchanting supplier, {npc:3005} the leatherworking supplier and {npc:3027} the cooking supplier, then combine them into {item:278078}."] = "{npc:269068}想要牛头人熏香：从草药商{npc:3014}、附魔供应商{npc:3012}、制皮供应商{npc:3005}和烹饪供应商{npc:3027}处购买四种材料，然后合成{item:278078}。",
	["{npc:275789} stands on the {area:821} a little east of the well."] = "漫行者{npc:275789}站在水井东边不远处的{area:821}上。",
	["{npc:277154} runs around the village: give him the {item:287505}"] = "{npc:277154}绕着村子跑：把{item:287505}交给他",
	["{npc:277182} stands at the north edge of the village. Kyle wants {item:287505} from plainstriders."] = "{npc:277182}站在村子北缘。Kyle想要平原陆行鸟身上的{item:287505}。",
	["{npc:277182}, at the north end of the village"] = "{npc:277182}，在村子北端",
	["{npc:2948}, for Hamuul in {zone:1456}"] = "{npc:2948}，交给{zone:1456}的大德鲁伊哈缪尔·符文图腾",
	["{npc:2950} walks around {area:16677}: look inside the circle on the map"] = "{npc:2950}在{area:16677}走动：看地图上的圆圈里",
	["{npc:2951}, below ground"] = "{npc:2951}，地下",
	["{npc:2981}, inside"] = "{npc:2981}，在里面",
	["{npc:2984} stands at the edge of the {area:404}, south of the well."] = "{npc:2984}站在水井南边的{area:404}边缘。",
	["{npc:2988} camps by the {area:396} south-east of Bloodhoof."] = "{npc:2988}在血蹄村东南方的{area:396}旁扎营。",
	["{npc:2988} walks around here: look inside the circle on the map"] = "{npc:2988}在这一带走动：看地图上的圆圈里",
	["{npc:2991} sits by the tent on the camp's eastern edge; the {object:2907} stands next to her."] = "{npc:2991}坐在营地东缘的帐篷旁；{object:2907}就在她旁边。",
	["{npc:2993}, for {npc:3057} in {zone:1456}"] = "{npc:2993}，交给{zone:1456}的{npc:3057}",
	["{npc:3033} trains druids in the Cenarion Circle's tent on {area:1639}."] = "{npc:3033}在{area:1639}塞纳里奥议会的帐篷里训练德鲁伊。",
	["{npc:3039}, beside {npc:3041}"] = "{npc:3039}，在{npc:3041}旁边",
	["{npc:3059}, the warrior trainer; inside"] = "{npc:3059}，战士训练师；在里面",
	["{npc:3060}, the druid trainer beside him"] = "{npc:3060}，他旁边的德鲁伊训练师",
	["{npc:3061}, the hunter trainer"] = "{npc:3061}，猎人训练师",
	["{npc:3062}, the shaman trainer in camp"] = "{npc:3062}，营地里的萨满祭司训练师",
	["{npc:3063}'s quest: beat three Novice Warriors (or players in duels) next to him."] = "{npc:3063}的任务：击败他旁边的三名{npc:10721}（或在决斗中击败玩家）。",
	["{npc:3065} stands at the north end of {area:222}. Tame with the {item:15908}: an {npc:2956} on the plains, a {npc:2959} north of the village, a {npc:2970} to the north-west."] = "{npc:3065}站在{area:222}北端。用{item:15908}驯服：平原上的{npc:2956}、村子北边的{npc:2959}、西北方向的{npc:2970}。",
	["{npc:3067}: Camping 101 asks you to learn it"] = "{npc:3067}：任务“露营入门”要求你学会它",
	["{npc:3155} in {zone:1411}; {zone:1412} has no rogue trainer"] = "{npc:3155}在{zone:1411}；{zone:1412}没有盗贼训练师",
	["{npc:3156} in {zone:1411}; {zone:1412} has no warlock trainer"] = "{npc:3156}在{zone:1411}；{zone:1412}没有术士训练师",
	["{npc:3209} walks around {area:221}: look inside the circle on the map"] = "{npc:3209}在{area:221}走动：看地图上的圆圈里",
	["{npc:3209}, next to {npc:2980}; walks around {area:221}: look inside the circle on the map"] = "{npc:3209}，在{npc:2980}旁边；在{area:221}走动：看地图上的圆圈里",
	["{npc:3222} walks around {area:222}: look inside the circle on the map"] = "{npc:3222}在{area:222}走动：看地图上的圆圈里",
	["{npc:3441}: for {quest:860} at the {area:380}"] = "{npc:3441}：交给{area:380}的{quest:860}",
	["{npc:3449}: the harpies come later, in the {area:383}"] = "{npc:3449}：鹰身女妖以后才会出现，在{area:383}",
	["{npc:3483} sells armor on the north side of the {area:380}. His bundle goes to {npc:3615}, who sends it with you on the flight to {zone:1456} you take for {npc:3033} anyway."] = "{npc:3483}在{area:380}北侧出售护甲。他的包裹要交给{npc:3615}；你反正会为{npc:3033}飞往{zone:1456}，他就让包裹随你一同送达。",
	["{npc:3615}, the wind rider master"] = "{npc:3615}，驭风者管理员",
	["{npc:5769}: for {npc:3448} at the {area:380}"] = "{npc:5769}：交给{area:380}的{npc:3448}",
	["{npc:5888} stands in {area:221}. {quest:1516} needs level 4, which you reach with the turn-ins here."] = "{npc:5888}站在{area:221}。{quest:1516}需要4级，交完这里的任务就能达到。",
	["{npc:5888}: {npc:5873} and your {item:5175}"] = "{npc:5888}：{npc:5873}和你的{item:5175}",
	["{npc:5906}, a few steps from {npc:5543} on {area:1640}"] = "{npc:5906}，在{area:1640}上距{npc:5543}几步远",
	["{npc:6746}, at the south end of the central rise: the hearth from {quest:5922} brings you back here"] = "{npc:6746}，在中央高地的南端：{quest:5922}的炉石会把你带回这里",
	["{npc:6746}: {quest:5926}, for {npc:3033} on {area:1639}"] = "{npc:6746}：{quest:5926}，为{area:1639}上的{npc:3033}而做",
	["{npc:6775} stands at the west end of the camp, at the north-west corner of the hills where the Mountain Cougars prowl: take his quest, hunt the cougars from there south and east, then come back up to {npc:2980}."] = "{npc:6775}站在营地西端，位于{npc:2961}出没的山丘西北角：接下他的任务，从那里向南和向东猎杀美洲狮，然后回到{npc:2980}处。",
	["{npc:8359}, by the wind riders on the central rise"] = "{npc:8359}，在中央高地的驭风者旁",
	["{object:2910}, 170 yd east"] = "{object:2910}，向东170码",
	["{quest:96130}, a lone wolf, prowls the plains west of the village. Prairie Stalkers and Flatland Cougars roam the plains north and west of it."] = "{quest:96130}是一只独狼，在村子西边的平原上潜行。{npc:2959}和{npc:3035}在村子北边和西边的平原上游荡。",
	["{zone:1412}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{zone:1412}：遇到就杀",
}

G["forever/horde/troll/01-durotar"] = {
	["Armored Scorpid"] = "装甲蝎子",
	["Armored Scorpids crawl over the plains west of {area:362}. Tame one, then return to {npc:3171}."] = "装甲蝎子在{area:362}以西的平原爬行。驯服一只，然后回到{npc:3171}。",
	["Back east to the shore north of {npc:275657}. Spitelash Scouts and Attendants hold the beach below {area:370}. Hunters: tame a {npc:3107} on the beach."] = "向东回到{npc:275657}北边的海岸。{npc:275662}和其他恶鞭纳迦占据着{area:370}下方的海滩。猎人：在海滩上驯服一只{npc:3107}。",
	["Back south to {area:362}."] = "向南返回{area:362}。",
	["Back to the Den"] = "返回洞穴",
	["Back to {area:14}"] = "回到{area:14}",
	["Back to {area:362}."] = "返回{area:362}。",
	["Back to {npc:5875} in the {object:172960}. Use the {item:7464} on the summoning circle there and defeat the voidwalker to bind it."] = "回到{object:172960}找{npc:5875}。在那里的召唤法阵上使用{item:7464}，击败虚空行者以束缚它。",
	["Below ground"] = "在地下",
	["Burning Blade cultists hold the caves of {quest:827}; any of them drops a {item:4871}. {npc:3204}, a level 14 warlock, stands deep inside and drops the {item:4903}."] = "火刃氏族祭司占据着{quest:827}的洞穴；任何一个都会掉落{item:4871}。{npc:3204}是14级术士，站在洞穴深处，掉落{item:4903}。",
	["Class trainer"] = "职业训练师",
	["Deathskip to Northern Durotar"] = "死亡跳过到北杜隆塔尔",
	["Die to the mobs at 52.0,21.4 ({npc:3118}): a death there sends you to this graveyard. Release your spirit and take the {npc:6491}'s resurrection."] = "在52.0,21.4（{npc:3118}）处死在怪物手里：在那里死亡会把你送到这个墓地。释放灵魂，接受{npc:6491}的复活。",
	["Dire Mottled Boar"] = "凶暴杂斑野猪",
	["Druid trainer"] = "德鲁伊训练师",
	["Dustwind Savage"] = "尘风野蛮人",
	["Dustwind Storm Witch"] = "尘风风暴女巫",
	["Felstalkers roam the slope below the cave, on the valley's north side."] = "地狱捕猎者在山谷北侧、洞穴下方的山坡上游荡。",
	["Follow the road east out of the valley to {area:367} on the coast."] = "沿道路向东离开山谷，到海岸边的{area:367}。",
	["Follow the road north from {area:362} to {zone:1454}'s main gate, just west of {area:817}. {npc:3352} stands with the hunter trainers in the {object:172958}."] = "从{area:362}沿路向北到{zone:1454}正门，就在{area:817}以西。{npc:3352}和猎人训练师们站在{object:172958}里。",
	["Follow the road west from {area:362} over the {area:814} bridge; {area:379} sits just above it on the {area:17} side."] = "从{area:362}沿路向西，过{area:814}桥；{area:379}就在桥上方{area:17}那一侧。",
	["Follow the road west from {area:362} over the {area:814} bridge; {npc:5810} stands at {area:379}, just above it on the {area:17} side."] = "从{area:362}沿路向西，过{area:814}桥；{npc:5810}站在{area:379}，就在桥上方{area:17}那一侧。",
	["Free {npc:275811} and see her safely out of the crag"] = "救出{npc:275811}，护送她安全离开峭壁",
	["Head north-east to the road toward {zone:1454}. {npc:3293} camps beside it; the stolen sacks lie along the road south of him."] = "向东北到通往{zone:1454}的路上。{npc:3293}在路边扎营；被偷的麻袋散落在他以南的路边。",
	["Head south through the isles. The Loa idols lie all over the southern isles; Voodoo and Hexed Trolls hold them and drop the Hexed Pendants. {quest:826} and Minshina's cage are on the southernmost isle.\nWade back west to the shore south of Sen'jin. Durotar Tigers roam it and the Taillasher eggs sit in nests along the beach."] = "向南穿过群岛。洛阿神像遍布南部岛屿；巫毒巨魔和中邪的巨魔守着它们，并掉落中邪吊坠。{quest:826}和明希娜的笼子在最南边的岛上。\n向西涉水回到森金以南的海岸。杜隆塔尔猛虎在那里游荡，鞭尾鳄的蛋在沿海滩的巢里。",
	["Hexed Troll"] = "中邪的巨魔",
	["Inside"] = "在里面",
	["Inside the cave, go straight on at the first split, then right and follow the stream on your left to the waterfall: the pick glows by the water, behind a column of rock."] = "进入洞穴后，在第一个岔口直走，然后右转，沿左手边的溪流走到瀑布：镐在水边、一根石柱后面发光。",
	["Inside the cave, keep to the right wall all the way round, over the stream: {npc:3183} waits at the end."] = "进入洞穴后，一直沿右侧洞壁绕行，越过溪流：{npc:3183}在尽头等候。",
	["Into {zone:1454}"] = "进入{zone:1454}",
	["Kul Tiras Marine"] = "库尔提拉斯水兵",
	["Kul Tiras Sailor"] = "库尔提拉斯水手",
	["Lazy Peon"] = "懒惰的苦工",
	["Level 10"] = "10级",
	["Lieutenant Benedict"] = "本尼迪克特中尉",
	["Mage trainer"] = "法师训练师",
	["Makrura and surf crawlers line the beaches north-east of Sen'jin.\nThe gnomish toolboxes lie in the wreckage along the shore east and south-east of {area:362}. Follow the shore south to Sen'jin."] = "龙虾人和冲浪蟹分布在森金东北的海滩上。\n侏儒工具箱在{area:362}以东和东南沿岸的残骸里。沿海岸向南到森金。",
	["Misha's hut stands south of the lizards. The crocolisks along the {area:814} to the west carry {item:4891}."] = "米莎·托克伦的小屋在蜥蜴南边。西边{area:814}沿岸的鳄鱼带着{item:4891}。",
	["Mottled Boar"] = "杂斑野猪",
	["On the way"] = "顺路",
	["Paladin trainer"] = "圣骑士训练师",
	["Prickly pears"] = "仙人掌果",
	["Quilboars and scouts hold the huts west of town; dustrunners and battleguards hold the camps farther west."] = "钢鬃野猪人和钢鬃斥候占据着镇子西边的小屋；钢鬃传令兵和钢鬃卫兵占据着更西边的营地。",
	["Razormane Battleguard"] = "钢鬃战斗卫士",
	["Razormane Dustrunner"] = "钢鬃逐尘者",
	["Razormane Quilboar"] = "钢鬃野猪人",
	["Razormane Scout"] = "钢鬃斥候",
	["Ridgeshade Creeper"] = "脊影爬行者",
	["Ridgeshade Lurker"] = "脊影潜伏者",
	["Savages and Storm Witches nest in {area:370}, east of {npc:3293}. A Storm Witch drops the {item:277661}. Shamans: the Burning Blade Cultists by {area:371}, at the ravine's south end, drop the {item:6652}."] = "野蛮人和风暴女巫盘踞在{npc:3293}以东的{area:370}。风暴女巫会掉{item:277661}。萨满注意：峡谷南端{area:371}旁的火刃教徒掉{item:6652}。",
	["Spitelash naga"] = "恶鞭纳迦",
	["Summoned Voidwalker"] = "被召唤的虚空行者",
	["Surf Crawler"] = "冲浪蟹",
	["Tame it with the {item:15908}"] = "用{item:15908}驯服它",
	["The keep stands on the coast south-east of {area:362}. The raiders' axe, bow and shield lie on its outskirts. Sailors and marines drop the {item:4870}. {npc:3192} waits at the top of the keep; his key opens the chest beside him, which holds the {item:4881}."] = "城堡位于{area:362}东南方的海岸上。袭击者的斧头、弓和盾牌在城堡外围。库尔提拉斯水手和库尔提拉斯水兵掉落{item:4870}。{npc:3192}在城堡顶层等候；他的钥匙能打开他旁边的箱子，里面有{item:4881}。",
	["The prickly pears grow among the quilboar huts just west of town."] = "仙人掌果生长在镇子西边的野猪人小屋之间。",
	["The weapons lie around the Den and the training grounds; the Mottled Boars roam the whole valley floor."] = "被遗弃的训练武器散落在洞穴和训练场周围；{npc:3098}在整个山谷谷底游荡。",
	["The {object:58595} stands in {area:817}, among the cultists you just fought."] = "{object:58595}在{area:817}，就在你刚才对付的祭司中间。",
	["Thunder Lizards and Lightning Hides graze on {area:369} across the bridge; any of them can drop a {item:6486}."] = "{npc:3130}和{npc:3131}在桥对面的{area:369}上吃草；任何一只都可能掉落{item:6486}。",
	["Thunder Lizards and Lightning Hides graze on {area:369}, just west and south-west of {npc:3293}.\nFizzle holds the Burning Blade camp on {area:369}, north-west of {area:362}. Hunters: tame a {npc:3099} with the {item:15908} on the way.\nCareful: Burning Blade cultists surround Fizzle, some linked so they aggro in pairs, and they respawn quickly."] = "雷霆蜥蜴和闪电皮蜥蜴在{npc:3293}正西和西南的{area:369}吃草。\n菲兹尔占据着{area:362}西北{area:369}上的火刃营地。猎人注意：途中用{item:15908}驯服一只{npc:3099}。\n注意：火刃教徒围着菲兹尔，有些是联动的会成对仇恨，而且刷新很快。",
	["Thunder lizards across the river"] = "河对岸的雷霆蜥蜴",
	["Top up here to level 10: {quest:840}, at {area:362}, needs level 10."] = "在这里补到10级：{area:362}的{quest:840}需要10级。",
	["Training weapons and boars"] = "训练武器和野猪",
	["Underwater"] = "水下",
	["Upstairs"] = "楼上",
	["Vile Familiar"] = "邪灵劣魔",
	["Voodoo Troll"] = "巫毒巨魔",
	["Wade across to the northern Echo Isle. The Matriarch prowls among the raptors there."] = "涉水到回音群岛北部的岛屿。血爪族母在那里的迅猛龙中间潜行。",
	["Wake {quest:5441} with the {item:16114}"] = "用{item:16114}叫醒{quest:5441}",
	["West over the {area:814} bridge, past {area:379} and on along the ridge: {npc:5907} stands alone above the Razormane camp."] = "向西过{area:814}桥，经过{area:379}沿山脊继续走：{npc:5907}独自站在钢鬃营地之上。",
	["While you're here: learn Staves from {npc:2704} ({object:172958}, 10 silver); a Hunter's melee weapon is mostly its stats, and two-handers carry the most."] = "在这里时：找{npc:2704}（{object:172958}，10银）学习法杖；猎人的近战武器主要看属性，双手武器属性最多。",
	["While you're here: learn Staves from {npc:2704} ({object:172958}, 10 silver); a staff carries more spell stats than a one-hander while you level."] = "在这里时：找{npc:2704}（{object:172958}，10银）学习法杖；升级期间法杖比单手武器提供更多法术属性。",
	["grind on {npc:3111}"] = "刷{npc:3111}",
	["the {object:654925} on the ground beside her"] = "她身旁地上的{object:654925}",
	["{area:363}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:363}：遇到就杀",
	["{area:366} lies west of Sen'jin. The three attack plans sit on the ground among the centaur tents. {npc:275811} is held at the crag as well."] = "{area:366}在森金村西边。三份进攻计划在半人马帐篷之间的地上。{npc:275811}也被关押在峭壁。",
	["{area:368}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:368}：遇到就杀",
	["{area:369}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:369}：遇到就杀",
	["{area:373}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:373}：遇到就杀",
	["{area:817}'s mouth"] = "{area:817}的入口",
	["{item:11583} along the way to Back to the Den"] = "前往“回到兽穴”途中的{item:11583}",
	["{item:11583} on the way"] = "{item:11583}，途中",
	["{item:277135} along the way to {area:367}"] = "前往{area:367}途中的{item:277135}",
	["{item:277135} on the way"] = "{item:277135}，途中",
	["{item:4862} on the way"] = "{item:4862}，途中",
	["{npc:10176}, where you start"] = "{npc:10176}，你的出发点",
	["{npc:11378}, at the lumber pile east of the Den"] = "{npc:11378}，在巢穴以东的木料堆处",
	["{npc:246344} in {zone:1456}; {area:362} has no paladin trainer"] = "{npc:246344}在{zone:1456}；{area:362}没有圣骑士训练师",
	["{npc:246344} in {zone:1456}; {area:363} has no paladin trainer"] = "{npc:246344}在{zone:1456}；{area:363}没有圣骑士训练师",
	["{npc:265809} camps just south of {area:362}. Sit by his campfire (/sit) until the {spell:1229451} buff appears."] = "{npc:265809}在{area:362}正南扎营。在他的营火旁坐下（/sit），直到出现{spell:1229451}增益。",
	["{npc:265809}'s campfire"] = "{npc:265809}的营火",
	["{npc:266881}: enchanters only, the residue is disenchanted from Hexed Pendants"] = "{npc:266881}：仅限附魔师，残渣通过分解{item:275724}获得",
	["{npc:266940}, inside"] = "{npc:266940}，在里面",
	["{npc:266940}, on the east side of town; inside"] = "{npc:266940}，在镇东侧；里面",
	["{npc:275657} stands on the shore east of {area:362}. The trident, banner and dagger lie on the beach around him."] = "{npc:275657}站在{area:362}东边的岸上。三叉戟、旗帜和匕首在他周围的海滩上。",
	["{npc:275666}, a young sea giant, walks {area:14}'s north coast, north of the naga beach. {npc:275666} is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "{npc:275666}，一只年轻的海巨人，在{area:14}北海岸走动，就在纳迦海滩以北。{npc:275666}是精英：建议组队。",
	["{npc:3034} in {zone:1412}; {area:362} has no druid trainer"] = "{npc:3034}在{zone:1412}；{area:362}没有德鲁伊训练师",
	["{npc:3034} in {zone:1412}; {area:363} has no druid trainer"] = "{npc:3034}在{zone:1412}；{area:363}没有德鲁伊训练师",
	["{npc:3102} hooves"] = "{npc:3102}的蹄子",
	["{npc:3142}, back in {area:362}"] = "{npc:3142}，回到{area:362}",
	["{npc:3142}: {npc:275666}, an elite sea giant"] = "{npc:3142}：{npc:275666}，一个精英海巨人",
	["{npc:3143} stands just inside the cave mouth; {npc:3159} at the back of the cave behind him."] = "{npc:3143}站在洞口内侧；{npc:3159}在他身后的洞穴深处。",
	["{npc:3143} waits inside the Den, the building just west of {npc:10176}."] = "{npc:3143}在{npc:10176}西边的建筑——试炼谷洞穴里等候。",
	["{npc:3143}, inside"] = "{npc:3143}，在里面",
	["{npc:3147}, in the watchtower"] = "{npc:3147}，在瞭望塔里",
	["{npc:3159}, at the back of the cave; below ground"] = "{npc:3159}，在洞穴深处；地下",
	["{npc:3169}, inside"] = "{npc:3169}，在里面",
	["{npc:3171}: {npc:3352} in {zone:1454} teaches {spell:5149}"] = "{npc:3171}：{zone:1454}的{npc:3352}教{spell:5149}",
	["{npc:3191}: Camping 101 asks you to learn it"] = "{npc:3191}：《露营入门》要求你学会它",
	["{npc:3287} lies wounded at the foot of the hills north-west of the Den."] = "{npc:3287}受伤躺在洞穴西北方的山脚下。",
	["{npc:3294}, by the inn"] = "{npc:3294}，在旅店旁",
	["{npc:3706}, for {npc:6018} in {zone:1454}: keep it"] = "{npc:3706}，交给{zone:1454}的{npc:6018}：先留着",
	["{npc:3707}, the priest trainer at the Den"] = "{npc:3707}，洞穴处的牧师训练师",
	["{npc:5880}, the mage trainer in Sen'jin"] = "{npc:5880}，森金的法师训练师",
	["{npc:5884} in {area:14}; {area:362} has no mage trainer"] = "{npc:5884}在{area:14}；{area:362}没有法师训练师",
	["{npc:5887} stands outside the Den. {area:639} is the hill just south of it: drink the {item:6635} there to see the {npc:5891}, then take the {item:6656} back to {npc:5887}."] = "{npc:5887}站在洞穴外。{area:639}是洞穴南边的小山：在那里喝下{item:6635}以看到{npc:5891}，然后把{item:6656}带回给{npc:5887}。",
	["{npc:5887}: {npc:5873} and your {item:5175}"] = "{npc:5887}：{npc:5873}和你的{item:5175}",
	["{npc:5891}, on {area:639}"] = "{npc:5891}，在{area:639}",
	["{npc:6786} stands on the road at the valley's eastern exit."] = "{npc:6786}站在山谷东侧出口的路上。",
	["{npc:6928}, inside"] = "{npc:6928}，在里面",
	["{npc:9796}, by the cooking fire"] = "{npc:9796}，在烹饪火堆旁",
	["{quest:790}, a large scorpid, prowls the slope south of {npc:3287} among the Scorpid Workers; pick the Cactus Apples by the cactuses on the way.\nThe {quest:792} swarm the slope below the {area:365}, the cave on the valley's north side."] = "{quest:790}，一只大蝎子，在{npc:3287}以南的斜坡上蝎工之间游荡；路上顺便在仙人掌旁采仙人掌果。\n{quest:792}成群出现在{area:365}下方的斜坡上，那是山谷北侧的洞穴。",
	["{quest:828} camps on the hill west of the naga beach, south of {quest:827}."] = "{quest:828}在纳迦海滩西边、{quest:827}南边的山丘上扎营。",
	["{zone:1454}'s main gate is just west of {area:817}. {npc:5875} stands in the {object:172960}, the canyon under the {object:172982}."] = "{zone:1454}的正门就在{area:817}西边。{npc:5875}站在{object:172982}下方的峡谷{object:172960}里。",
}

G["forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades"] = {
	["/sit by her campfire until you get {spell:1229451}"] = "在她的营火旁输入/sit，直到获得{spell:1229451}",
	["Ask {npc:10666} for his report"] = "向{npc:10666}索取报告",
	["Ask {npc:1496} for his report"] = "向{npc:1496}索取报告",
	["Ask {npc:251001} for his report"] = "向{npc:251001}索取报告",
	["Back to the church"] = "返回教堂",
	["Back to {area:154}"] = "返回{area:154}",
	["Back to {area:85}"] = "回到{area:85}",
	["Back up the road to {area:159}."] = "沿道路返回{area:159}。",
	["Back up the road to {area:159}. {npc:2128} (mages), {npc:2129} (priests), {npc:2127} (warlocks) and {npc:2130} (rogues) stand upstairs in the inn: take the stairs inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "沿路回到{area:159}。{npc:2128}（法师）、{npc:2129}（牧师）、{npc:2127}（术士）和{npc:2130}（盗贼）在旅店楼上：从里面走楼梯，箭头分不清楼层。",
	["Back up to the forest's edge south of the keep's gate: {npc:246389} and {npc:259190} take the bones and the crystal."] = "回到城堡大门以南的森林边缘：{npc:246389}和{npc:259190}会收下骨头和水晶。",
	["Beat {npc:6784} in the duel"] = "在决斗中击败{npc:6784}",
	["Below ground"] = "地下",
	["Bleeding Horror"] = "流血恐怖",
	["Captain Perrine"] = "佩林队长",
	["Captain Vachon"] = "瓦尚队长",
	["Crusader's Outpost"] = "十字军前哨",
	["Dark Enforcer"] = "黑暗执行者",
	["Dark Neophyte"] = "黑暗新信徒",
	["Dry Branches"] = "干枯的树枝",
	["Duskbats and Darkhounds roam all along the road back west; finish the wings and hides on the way.\n{quest:96897} holds the farm just south-east of the camp. The Necrotic Crystal Fragments lie on the ground among the cultists, and the cultists carry some too."] = "暮色蝙蝠和黑暗猎犬沿回程西行的整条路都有；路上顺手完成翅膀和毛皮。\n{quest:96897}占据着营地东南的农场。腐朽水晶碎片散落在邪教徒之间的地上，邪教徒身上也会携带一些。",
	["Eleanor camps just south-west of town."] = "埃莉诺·沙克尔顿在镇子西南方不远处扎营。",
	["Escort {npc:275954} out of the outpost"] = "护送{npc:275954}离开前哨",
	["Follow the path north into {area:154}; Sarvis stands in front of the church."] = "沿小路向北进入{area:154}；暗影牧师萨维斯站在教堂前。",
	["Follow the road east. Bleeding Horrors and Wandering Spirits haunt the graves on the east side of the farmstead, where the {quest:99142} grows.\nThe Scarlet Friars camp just north-east of the graves; {npc:1664} stands among them.\nThe spiders lurk in the woods at the far east end of the glades."] = "沿路向东。流血恐怖和游荡的灵魂出没在农场东侧的墓地，{quest:99142}就在那里生长。\n血色修士在墓地东北扎营；{npc:1664}就在他们中间。\n蜘蛛潜伏在林地最东端的树林里。",
	["Follow the road north-west to {area:157}. {npc:1657} walks the graveyard south of the mills; Nissa, Gregor and {npc:1656} haunt the mills themselves. Rattlecage and Cracked Skull Soldiers drop the ribs, Darkeye Bonecasters the skulls, and any of them may drop {item:2839}. From here on, kill the Duskbats and Darkhounds you pass: {npc:3549} wants their wings and hides.\nCareful: Rotting undead and Darkeye Bonecasters near the Agamands can join a fight as adds."] = "沿路向西北到{area:157}。{npc:1657}在磨坊以南的墓地走动；妮莎、格雷戈尔和{npc:1656}出没在磨坊本身。响骨士兵和裂颅士兵掉落肋骨，黑眼缚骨者掉落头骨，其中任何一个都可能掉落{item:2839}。从现在起，杀掉你经过的暮色蝙蝠和黑暗猎犬：{npc:3549}要它们的翅膀和毛皮。\n注意：阿加曼德附近的腐烂亡灵和黑眼缚骨者会作为援兵加入战斗。",
	["Follow the road south-east from {area:159} past the zeppelin towers. Linnea, Kristof and {npc:3549} camp by the road."] = "沿道路从{area:159}向东南经过飞艇塔。亡灵卫兵林奈、亡灵卫兵克里斯托弗和{npc:3549}在路旁扎营。",
	["Follow the road south-west from {area:159} to the Scarlet Crusade camp. {npc:1662} stands at its south end; every Scarlet there can drop a ring."] = "沿道路从{area:159}向西南到血色十字军营地。{npc:1662}站在营地南端；那里的每个血色十字军都可能掉落戒指。",
	["Follow the road west past {area:157} to the {area:16616}. Leonid stands just north of {npc:246389}'s camp.\n{npc:246389} and {npc:259190} camp at the forest's edge just south of Leonid. Every class can take both quests once {quest:96896} is handed in (level 10); take them if they are offered. They send you into the cellar under {area:16881}, the next stop."] = "沿路向西经过{area:157}到{area:16616}。列昂尼德就站在{npc:246389}营地的北边。\n{npc:246389}和{npc:259190}在列昂尼德以南的森林边缘扎营。所有职业都能在交完{quest:96896}（10级）后接取这两个任务；如果接到就接下来。它们会派你去{area:16881}下方的地窖，也就是下一站。",
	["Free the {npc:271961}"] = "解救{npc:271961}",
	["Greater Duskbats fly over the fields around {area:159} and along the road north.\nThe Rot Hide Graverobbers dig through the graveyards north of {area:159}; all the Rot Hides drop the ichor.\nThe Rot Hide Mongrels hold the hills further north. {npc:1753} (level 11) stands in their camp on the hill south of the shore: clear the gnolls around him first.\nThe Vile Fin murlocs line the north shore.\nThe {quest:5482} grows in the graveyard fields just north of {area:159}.\nCareful: Gnoll guards stand outside the hut and can join the fight. If you slip past them and fight him inside, he fights alone."] = "大暮色蝙蝠飞过{area:159}周围的田野，并沿北边的道路飞行。\n腐皮盗墓者在{area:159}以北的墓地挖掘；所有腐皮都会掉落腐液。\n腐皮疯狗占据更北边的丘陵。{npc:1753}（11级）站在岸边南面山上的它们的营地里：先清掉他周围的豺狼人。\n邪鳍鱼人沿着北岸排开。\n{quest:5482}生长在{area:159}正北的墓地田野里。\n注意：豺狼人卫兵守在屋外，会加入战斗。如果你绕过他们进屋打他，他就是单挑。",
	["Head west to the cave. The Young Night Web Spiders sit outside; the Night Web Spiders and the cocooned {npc:271961} are inside.\nCareful: A low-level character can die quickly if it pulls several Night Web Spiders in the cave at the same time."] = "向西去山洞。小夜网蜘蛛在外面；夜网蜘蛛和被茧包裹的{npc:271961}在里面。\n注意：低级角色如果同时引到洞里几只夜网蜘蛛，很容易死。",
	["Inside"] = "内部",
	["Leave {area:154} by the road north-east. {npc:6784} stands by the farmhouse at the {area:156}."] = "沿东北方的道路离开{area:154}。{npc:6784}站在{area:156}的农舍旁。",
	["Listen to Leonid and {npc:246378}, then talk to him again"] = "听莱尼德·巴萨罗梅和{npc:246378}说话，然后再次与他交谈",
	["Mindless Zombie"] = "无脑僵尸",
	["Mindless Zombies"] = "{npc:1501}",
	["More Vile Fin murlocs walk the shore just north of the outpost."] = "前哨北边的海岸上还有更多邪鳍鱼人。",
	["Night Web Spider"] = "夜网蜘蛛",
	["Offer aid to the {npc:246143}"] = "向{npc:246143}提供帮助",
	["On the way"] = "路上",
	["Only if the letter dropped"] = "仅当信件已掉落",
	["Paladin: {quest:91285}"] = "圣骑士：{quest:91285}",
	["Paladin: {quest:96899}"] = "圣骑士：{quest:96899}",
	["Rattlecage Skeleton"] = "响骨骷髅",
	["Rattlecage Skeletons wander the ruined houses in the north half of {area:154}. Young Scavengers and Duskbats roam all around the village; the Ragged Scavengers and Mangy Duskbats are on its east side."] = "{npc:1890}在{area:154}北半部的废弃房屋里游荡。{npc:1508}和夜行蝙蝠在村子周围游荡；{npc:1509}和{npc:1513}在村子东侧。",
	["Rot Hide Graverobber"] = "腐皮盗墓者",
	["Rot Hide Mongrel"] = "腐皮疯狗",
	["Scarlet Friar"] = "血色修士",
	["Scarlet Missionary"] = "血色传教士",
	["Scarlet Warrior"] = "血色战士",
	["Scarlet Warriors guard the outpost just west of the pumpkin fields. {npc:275954} is held inside: talk to him and stay with him until he is out.\nCareful: Scarlet Warriors are level 6-7 and not elite. Once their health falls to 15% they run off to bring help, so more of them may join the fight."] = "血色战士守卫着南瓜田正西的哨站。{npc:275954}被关在里面：和他交谈，并跟着他直到他脱身。\n注意：血色战士是6-7级、非精英。血量降到15%时他们会跑去找援兵，所以可能会有更多加入战斗。",
	["Scarlet Zealot"] = "血色狂热者",
	["Summoned Voidwalker"] = "召唤的虚空行者",
	["The Dry Branches lie on the ground around the south-west edge of {area:159}."] = "干枯的树枝散落在{area:159}西南边缘的地上。",
	["The Scarlet Converts and Initiates hold the farm east of {area:154}. {npc:1919} wanders between the farmhouses: his remains are for {quest:6395}."] = "{npc:1506}和血色新兵占据着{area:154}东边的农场。{npc:1919}在农舍之间游荡：他的遗骸用于{quest:6395}。",
	["The Scarlet farm"] = "血色农场",
	["The Vile Fin murlocs lurk on the bluffs just east of the keep and in the camps around the lake to the south-west, on the way down to {area:16881}."] = "邪鳍鱼人潜伏在城堡正东的悬崖上，也在西南湖泊周围、通往{area:16881}的路上营地中。",
	["The Wanted poster by the inn"] = "旅店旁的通缉布告",
	["The zombies shamble around the graveyard and the houses just east of the church."] = "僵尸在墓地和教堂东边的房屋周围蹒跚游荡。",
	["The {area:154} trainers stand around the church"] = "{area:154}的训练师站在教堂周围",
	["The {area:159} trainers are in and around the inn"] = "{area:159}的训练师在旅店内外",
	["The {area:2119} is the big inn in the middle, with {npc:1515} in front of it."] = "{area:2119}是中间那家大旅店，{npc:1515}就在店门前。",
	["The {npc:1931}, in the town hall basement"] = "{npc:1931}，在城镇大厅的地下室",
	["The {npc:2211}, in the town hall basement"] = "{npc:2211}，在城镇大厅的地下室",
	["The {npc:246143}"] = "{npc:246143}",
	["The {object:164662} lie beside the ruined houses in the north of {area:154}."] = "{object:164662}在{area:154}北部的废弃房屋旁。",
	["Tirisfal Pumpkins"] = "{object:375}",
	["Ulag the Cleaver"] = "劈砍者乌拉格",
	["Use the {item:286176} on five idle Deathguards around town"] = "对镇子周围五名闲着的亡灵卫兵使用{item:286176}",
	["Vile Fin Attacker"] = "邪鳍攻击者",
	["Vile Fin Attackers"] = "邪鳍攻击者",
	["Vile Fin Seer"] = "邪鳍先知",
	["Vile Fin Seers"] = "邪鳍先知",
	["Vile Fin shore"] = "邪鳍海岸",
	["Walk south from {area:159} to the {area:153} and down into the {zone:1458}. {npc:4568} stands in the {object:36082}. The Scarlet camp is just west of the ruins."] = "从{area:159}向南走到{area:153}，再往下进入{zone:1458}。{npc:4568}站在{object:36082}。血色营地就在废墟西边。",
	["Walk south from {area:159} to the {area:153} and down into the {zone:1458}. {npc:5675} stands in the {object:36082}. The Scarlet camp is just west of the ruins."] = "从{area:159}向南走到{area:153}，再往下进入{zone:1458}。{npc:5675}站在{object:36082}。血色营地就在废墟西边。",
	["Walk south-west from the mills: the pumpkins grow in the Scarlet-held fields north-west of Solliden.\nCareful: Farmers stand close to the pumpkins, so you can pull more than one at once. Scarlet mobs are found around the edges of the farm and a bit to the northwest."] = "从磨坊向西南走：南瓜生长在索利登西北血色控制的田野里。\n注意：农夫站得离南瓜很近，所以你可能一次引到不止一个。农场边缘以及西北一点的地方都有血色怪物。",
	["Wandering Spirit"] = "游荡的灵魂",
	["Webbed Forsaken"] = "被蛛网缠住的被遗忘者",
	["Wretched Zombie"] = "悲惨僵尸",
	["You rise in the crypt at the south end of {area:154}. {npc:1568} waits just outside."] = "你在{area:154}南端的墓穴中苏醒。{npc:1568}就在外面等候。",
	["Young Night Web Spider"] = "小夜网蜘蛛",
	["Zeppelin to {zone:1454}"] = "乘飞艇到{zone:1454}",
	["attack the cocoons inside the cave to free them; below ground"] = "在洞内攻击茧子来解救他们；在地下",
	["the Shadowvale Lurchers and Mystics drop the bones; below ground"] = "暗谷潜伏者和秘法师掉落骨头；在地下",
	["the basement under the ruined house"] = "废屋下方的地下室",
	["the {item:286269}, at the basement's south end"] = "{item:286269}，在地窖南端",
	["{area:154}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:154}：遇到就杀",
	["{area:165}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:165}：遇到就杀",
	["{area:166}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:166}：遇到就杀",
	["{area:16881} is the hollow at the west edge of the glades, south-west of the {area:16616}. Go down into the big basement under the ruined house (only a floor and a few pillars left, not the two-storey house): the bottles lie on its floor among the Shadowvale Lurchers and Mystics."] = "{area:16881}是林地西缘的凹地，在{area:16616}西南。下到废墟房屋下方的大地窖（只剩地板和几根柱子，不是那栋两层楼）：瓶子躺在地窖地板上，周围是暗谷潜伏者和秘法师。",
	["{area:380} is your base for this guide. Everyone you need stands within a few steps of the inn."] = "{area:380}是本攻略的基地。你需要找的人都在旅店几步之内。",
	["{area:85}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:85}：遇到就杀",
	["{item:16333}, from {npc:1919}"] = "{item:16333}，来自{npc:1919}",
	["{item:2320} from {npc:2118}, for Gretchen"] = "从{npc:2118}处购买{item:2320}，交给格莉丝·戴玛",
	["{item:2839}, a rare drop"] = "{item:2839}，稀有掉落",
	["{item:3264} along the way to Back to the church"] = "{item:3264}，在返回教堂的路上",
	["{item:3265} along the way to Back to the church"] = "{item:3265}，在返回教堂的路上",
	["{item:3635}; inside"] = "{item:3635}；在里面",
	["{item:7227}, in the farmstead's garden"] = "{item:7227}，在农场的花园里",
	["{npc:10665} walks around {area:159}: look inside the circle on the map"] = "{npc:10665}在{area:159}一带走动：看地图圆圈内",
	["{npc:10666} on the road to {area:159}"] = "{npc:10666}，在通往{area:159}的路上",
	["{npc:10666} walks the long road west of {area:159}, past {area:166}, and back: the arrow follows his road west until you meet him."] = "{npc:10666}沿着{area:159}以西的长路走过{area:166}再折返：箭头沿他西行的路线，直到你遇见他。",
	["{npc:10666} walks the road between {area:166} and {area:159}: take {quest:5481} when you pass him and pick the {item:12737} along the road."] = "{npc:10666}在{area:166}和{area:159}之间的路上行走：经过他时接取{quest:5481}，并沿路采集{item:12737}。",
	["{npc:10666}, the big abomination, walks the road from here east past {area:166} almost to {area:159}, and back: if he isn't at the arrow, follow the road east until you meet him. The {item:12737} grows along the road around him."] = "{npc:10666}这只大憎恶沿路从这里向东经过{area:166}直到接近{area:159}，再折返：如果他不在箭头处，就沿路向东走直到遇见他。{item:12737}生长在他附近的路边。",
	["{npc:1495}'s camp"] = "{npc:1495}的营地",
	["{npc:1496} stands in {area:159}. {npc:6390} waits in the mausoleum on the hill just north of town: open the gate and fight him."] = "{npc:1496}站在{area:159}。{npc:6390}在镇子北边山丘上的陵墓里等候：打开大门与他战斗。",
	["{npc:1499}, in the town hall"] = "{npc:1499}，在城镇大厅里",
	["{npc:1499}, inside"] = "{npc:1499}，在里面",
	["{npc:1500}, in the inn"] = "{npc:1500}，在旅店里",
	["{npc:1500}, inside"] = "{npc:1500}，在里面",
	["{npc:1518}, inside"] = "{npc:1518}，在里面",
	["{npc:1519} stands by the road at the {area:156}."] = "{npc:1519}站在{area:156}处的路边。",
	["{npc:1521}, upstairs"] = "{npc:1521}，在楼上",
	["{npc:1525} and Ravaged Corpses shamble through the fields just west of {area:159}; Darkhounds roam a little further west, toward {npc:10666}."] = "{npc:1525}和{npc:1526}在{area:159}西边的田野里蹒跚游荡；黑暗犬在更西边、靠近{npc:10666}的地方游荡。",
	["{npc:1529} along the way to {npc:1495}'s camp"] = "{npc:1529}，在前往{npc:1495}营地的路上",
	["{npc:1532} along the way to {npc:1495}'s camp"] = "{npc:1532}，在前往{npc:1495}营地的路上",
