	["{area:369} and {area:410}"] = "{area:369}和{area:410}",
	["{area:816} and the {area:368}"] = "{area:816}和{area:368}",
	["{item:14047} to Exalted, with the old {zone:1411} quests as a fast extra that pays {zone:1454} too if they still pay in full."] = "靠{item:14047}冲到崇拜，旧的{zone:1411}任务是快速的额外来源——若它们仍是全额奖励，还能同时获得{zone:1454}声望。",
	["{item:14047}: the Scarlet at {area:2266} in the {zone:1423}, the Gordok ogres outside {area:2577} in {zone:1444} and the Twilight camps of {zone:1451} drop it about one kill in three. The Auction House is faster if you have gold."] = "{item:14047}：{zone:1423}{area:2266}的血色十字军、{zone:1444}{area:2577}外的戈多克食人魔和{zone:1451}的暮光营地约三杀出一。有金币的话拍卖行更快。",
	["{item:14047}: the Scarlet outside {area:2266}"] = "{item:14047}：{area:2266}外的血色十字军",
	["{item:2592}: the Thistlefur furbolgs drop it about one kill in four"] = "{item:2592}：蓟皮熊怪约四杀出一",
