	["{npc:3203} keeps a Burning Blade camp in {area:369}, south of {zone:1454}, among the thunder lizards. The supply sacks lie in {area:410}, north of {area:362}. {item:4891} drops from the crocolisks along the river to the west, about one in ten."] = "{npc:3203}在{zone:1454}以南的{area:369}设有火刃营地，周围都是雷霆蜥蜴。补给袋在{area:362}以北的{area:410}。{item:4891}由西面河边的鳄鱼掉落，约十杀出一。",
	["{npc:3287}: {quest:790}, +100"] = "{npc:3287}：{quest:790}，+100",
