	["{quest:7837}: 20 {item:14047} for 50 reputation, as often as you like. Friendly to Honored is 6,000: 120 hand-ins, 2,400 {item:14047}, less what the quests gave you (a troll starts at Friendly 1,000: 100 hand-ins; an Undead or Skyborne at Neutral 2,000 first needs 20 more to reach Friendly). Hand in every 20 you carry, one after another."] = "{quest:7837}：20张{item:14047}换50点声望，可无限重复。友善到尊敬是6000点：120次交付，2400张{item:14047}，再减去任务已给的（巨魔从友善1000点开始：100次交付；亡灵或天裔从中立2000点开始，需先多交20次才到友善）。身上每攒够20张就连续交掉。",
