	["{quest:969} is level 60, so it pays in full. {npc:11755} in {area:2255} sends you to {npc:10307}, who stands in the same town. The {item:12334} lie on the ground in {area:2249}, the canyon at the south end of {zone:1452}, and the Frostmaul Giants there drop them too (about one in five). The giants are elite level 59 and 60 and stand close together: pick the shards at the edges, pull one giant at a time, or bring a friend."] = "{quest:969}是60级任务，所以全额给声望。{area:2255}的{npc:11755}让你去找同镇的{npc:10307}。{item:12334}散落在{area:2249}——{zone:1452}南端的峡谷——的地上，那里的霜槌巨人也会掉落（约五杀出一）。巨人是59和60级精英且站位密集：捡边缘的碎片，一次拉一个巨人，或者带上朋友。",
