	["{area:1997}: last hand-in"] = "{area:1997}：最后一次交任务",
	["{area:2437} opens off the {object:172960}. {npc:11518} and {npc:11519} wait at the far end."] = "{area:2437}从{object:172960}进入。{npc:11518}和{npc:11519}在最深处等候。",
	["{area:340} in the {zone:1418} hands out {faction:76} quests for {area:1584} and {area:1583}, all level 58 to 60 and paid in full: Precarious Predicament and Operation: Death to Angerforge (150 each), {quest:4724} and {item:12652} (100 each), {quest:4903} (150), {npc:3144}'s Wisdom (100) and For The Horde! (Rend's head, 200 to every Horde city). These are dungeon quests: take them when your group goes."] = "{zone:1418}的{area:340}会发放{area:1584}和{area:1583}的{faction:76}任务，都是58到60级且全额奖励：“命悬一线”和“行动：杀死安格弗将军”（各150），{quest:4724}和{item:12652}（各100），{quest:4903}（150），{npc:3144}的智慧（100）以及“为了部落！”（雷德之首，给所有部落城市200）。这些是副本任务：随队前往时接。",
