	["{area:816} and the {area:368}"] = "{area:816}和{area:368}",
	["{faction:76} reputation comes from quests and cloth. {npc:14726}, the cloth quartermaster, stands in the Drag beside the cloth and leather armor shop. She takes four one-time donations of 60 cloth (150 each) and then {quest:7832}, 20 {item:14047} for 50, as often as you like. Every point you earn with {faction:76} also gives a quarter as much to {zone:1456}, the {zone:1458} and the Darkspear Trolls. While you level, do {faction:76}'s quests within 5 levels of them: {zone:1411} at 5 to 12, the {area:380} at 12 to 20, {npc:4949}'s {quest:5726} at 12 to 16. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10%. Rewards: at Honored Orgrimmar's merchants sell to you for 10% less (the Classic rule), the wolf vendor included; at Exalted other races can buy the wolves: 20 gold for a level 40 wolf, 200 gold for a swift wolf at level 60, once you have mount training. {faction:76} has no tabard or other reward."] = "{faction:76}声望来自任务和布料。布料军需官{npc:14726}站在暗巷区，布料与皮甲店旁。她会收四次一次性捐献，每次60块布（各150点），之后是{quest:7832}，20个{item:14047}换50点，不限次数。你在{faction:76}获得的每一点声望，也会给{zone:1456}、{zone:1458}和暗矛巨魔各四分之一。升级过程中，做与自身等级相差5级以内的{faction:76}任务：{zone:1411}在5到12级，{area:380}在12到20级，{npc:4949}的{quest:5726}在12到16级。传承特权“外交家”最多加10%。奖励：尊敬时奥格瑞玛商人给你打九折（经典旧世规则），包括卖狼的商人；崇拜后其他种族可买狼：40级的狼20金，60级的迅捷狼200金，前提是已学骑术。{faction:76}没有战袍或其他奖励。",
